  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Core Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on parallel development of key components: the flight controller and camera controller within the engine, the audio manager, and scene management elements. The goal is to establish a robust foundation upon which the procedural 3D spaceship builder can be constructed.\n\n\n**Analyzing Flight Control**\n\nI\'m currently deep-diving into the `FlightController.ts` within the engine. I\'m carefully analyzing how mouse input translates to ship orientation, making sure I understand the right-hand rule and how to apply it. I\'m paying special attention to ensuring the correct direction of rotation given mouse inputs and `invertY` settings.\n\n\n**Verifying Axis Rotations**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously verifying the flight control axes. I\'m focusing on the right-hand rule and the application of rotations around local axes, especially in the context of the `-Z` facing orientation. I\'m confirming that yaw, pitch, and roll all align with expected behaviors, considering both input and the `invertY` setting. I\'m also planning to smooth mouse steering using an exponentially damped angular velocity accumulator.\n\n\n**Implementing Flight Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now implementing subtle forward momentum, stopping, and reversing with the \'S\' key.  I\'m also adding explosive afterburner acceleration on \'Shift\', even when \'W\' isn\'t pressed. I\'m focused on clean handling.\n\n**Designing Chase Camera**\n\nI\'m working on the chase camera in `CameraController.ts`. It follows the ship with a slight Y-axis offset for a clean view, using smooth interpolation with exponential damping for a dynamic feel. I\'m also adding a dynamic FOV widening on boost and a subtle speed shake.\n\n**Defining Fighter Geometry**\n\nI\'m starting on the ship 3D geometry. I\'m focusing on crafting an iconic futuristic fighter silhouette for the Interceptor (VX-9 VANGUARD).\n\n\n**Defining Fighter Geometries**\n\nI\'m now expanding the fighter geometry definitions to include two additional ships: the Striker (`SR-4 VALKYRIE`) and the Destroyer (`HX-12 AEGIS`). Each will be a composite `THREE.Group` with over fourteen beveled/extruded PBR sub-meshes, detailing sculpted fuselages, aerodynamic wings, and armored canopies. I\'m focusing on metallic thruster nozzles, inner incandescent cores, glowing stator rings, and dynamic volumetric plasma exhaust plumes, adding subtle light effects for realism, and am ready to write the associated files.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "KgX_av3oIZKhvdIP5a-a-Ak"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9505623761045697504"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport type { FlightStatus, FlightTelemetry, GameSettings, ShipConfig } from \'../types/game\';\\nimport type { InputSnapshot } from \'./InputManager\';\\n\\n// Reusable scratch objects (zero per-frame GC allocations)\\nconst _AXIS_X = new THREE.Vector3(1, 0, 0);\\nconst _AXIS_Y = new THREE.Vector3(0, 1, 0);\\nconst _AXIS_Z = new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 1);\\nconst _FORWARD_LOCAL = new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, -1);\\n\\nconst _qYaw = new THREE.Quaternion();\\nconst _qPitch = new THREE.Quaternion();\\nconst _qRoll = new THREE.Quaternion();\\nconst _forwardWorld = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _rightWorld = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _upWorld = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _desiredVel = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _euler = new THREE.Euler(0, 0, 0, \'YXZ\');\\n\\nexport function createInitialTelemetry(ship: ShipConfig): FlightTelemetry {\\n  return {\\n    speed: 0,\\n    signedSpeed: 0,\\n    maxSpeed: ship.flight.maxSpeed,\\n    effectiveMaxSpeed: ship.flight.maxSpeed,\\n    throttle: 0,\\n    boostEnergy: ship.flight.maxBoostEnergy,\\n    maxBoostEnergy: ship.flight.maxBoostEnergy,\\n    isBoosting: false,\\n    boostDepleted: false,\\n    boostIntensity: 0,\\n    hull: ship.maxHull,\\n    maxHull: ship.maxHull,\\n    yawRate: 0,\\n    pitchRate: 0,\\n    rollRate: 0,\\n    headingDeg: 0,\\n    pitchDeg: 0,\\n    rollDeg: 0,\\n    altitude: 0,\\n    status: \'STANDBY\',\\n    pointerLocked: false,\\n    fps: 60,\\n    frameTimeMs: 16.6,\\n    drawCalls: 0,\\n    triangles: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Arcade 6DOF space flight controller.\\n * Ship coordinate system: Forward = -Z, Right = +X, Up = +Y.\\n * Completely independent of React UI and ship geometry implementation.\\n */\\nexport class FlightController {\\n  public readonly position = new THREE.Vector3(0, 12, 40);\\n  public readonly quaternion = new THREE.Quaternion();\\n  public readonly velocity = new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, -24);\\n\\n  // Smoothed angular rates (rad/s) in ship local space\\n  public yawVelocity = 0;\\n  public pitchVelocity = 0;\\n  public rollVelocity = 0;\\n\\n  // Visual banking angle layered on the ship mesh for tactile feel\\n  public visualBankAngle = 0;\\n\\n  private ship: ShipConfig;\\n  private boostEnergy: number;\\n  private boostCooldownTimer = 0;\\n  private boostLockedOut = false;\\n  private boostIntensity = 0;\\n  private wasBoosting = false;\\n  private hull: number;\\n\\n  public constructor(ship: ShipConfig) {\\n    this.ship = ship;\\n    this.boostEnergy = ship.flight.maxBoostEnergy;\\n    this.hull = ship.maxHull;\\n  }\\n\\n  public setShipConfig(ship: ShipConfig): void {\\n    this.ship = ship;\\n    this.boostEnergy = Math.min(this.boostEnergy, ship.flight.maxBoostEnergy);\\n    this.hull = ship.maxHull;\\n  }\\n\\n  public reset(startPosition?: THREE.Vector3): void {\\n    if (startPosition) {\\n      this.position.copy(startPosition);\\n    } else {\\n      this.position.set(0, 12, 40);\\n    }\\n    this.quaternion.identity();\\n    this.velocity.set(0, 0, -28);\\n    this.yawVelocity = 0;\\n    this.pitchVelocity = 0;\\n    this.rollVelocity = 0;\\n    this.visualBankAngle = 0;\\n    this.boostEnergy = this.ship.flight.maxBoostEnergy;\\n    this.boostCooldownTimer = 0;\\n    this.boostLockedOut = false;\\n    this.boostIntensity = 0;\\n    this.wasBoosting = false;\\n    this.hull = this.ship.maxHull;\\n  }\\n\\n  public getBoostJustEngaged(): boolean {\\n    return this.boostJustEngaged;\\n  }\\n  private boostJustEngaged = false;\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Advances arcade flight simulation by delta time `dt` (seconds) and writes live telemetry.\\n   */\\n  public update(\\n    dt: number,\\n    input: InputSnapshot,\\n    settings: GameSettings,\\n    telemetry: FlightTelemetry,\\n  ): void {\\n    const profile = this.ship.flight;\\n    const safeDt = Math.min(Math.max(dt, 0.0001), 0.05);\\n\\n    // 1. Mouse-driven Yaw & Pitch (plus optional arrow key assistance)\\n    const sens = settings.mouseSensitivity;\\n    const mouseScale = 0.0042 * sens;\\n\\n    let targetYawInput = -input.mouseDeltaX * mouseScale / safeDt;\\n    const ySign = settings.invertY ? 1 : -1;\\n    let targetPitchInput = input.mouseDeltaY * mouseScale * ySign / safeDt;\\n\\n    if (input.keyYawLeft) targetYawInput += profile.yawSpeed * 0.85;\\n    if (input.keyYawRight) targetYawInput -= profile.yawSpeed * 0.85;\\n    if (input.keyPitchUp) targetPitchInput += profile.pitchSpeed * 0.85;\\n    if (input.keyPitchDown) targetPitchInput -= profile.pitchSpeed * 0.85;\\n\\n    // Clamp to max angular authority so fast mouse flicks feel aggressive yet controlled\\n    const maxYaw = profile.yawSpeed * (1.25 + sens * 0.35);\\n    const maxPitch = profile.pitchSpeed * (1.25 + sens * 0.35);\\n    targetYawInput = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(targetYawInput, -maxYaw, maxYaw);\\n    targetPitchInput = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(targetPitchInput, -maxPitch, maxPitch);\\n\\n    // Smooth response: snappy attack when mouse moves, crisp damping when released\\n    const mouseActive =\\n      Math.abs(input.mouseDeltaX) > 0.01 ||\\n      Math.abs(input.mouseDeltaY) > 0.01 ||\\n      input.keyYawLeft ||\\n      input.keyYawRight ||\\n      input.keyPitchUp ||\\n      input.keyPitchDown;\\n    const angularLambda = mouseActive ? profile.angularDamping * 1.9 : profile.angularDamping * 1.35;\\n    const angularAlpha = 1 - Math.exp(-angularLambda * safeDt);\\n\\n    this.yawVelocity = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(this.yawVelocity, targetYawInput, angularAlpha);\\n    this.pitchVelocity = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(this.pitchVelocity, targetPitchInput, angularAlpha);\\n\\n    // 2. Independent Roll via A / D\\n    let rollDir = 0;\\n    if (input.rollLeft) rollDir += 1;\\n    if (input.rollRight) rollDir -= 1;\\n    const targetRollRate = rollDir * profile.rollSpeed;\\n    const rollAlpha = 1 - Math.exp(-(profile.angularDamping * 1.25) * safeDt);\\n    this.rollVelocity = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(this.rollVelocity, targetRollRate, rollAlpha);\\n\\n    // 3. Apply local-space quaternion rotations (zero gimbal lock in 6DOF space!)\\n    _qYaw.setFromAxisAngle(_AXIS_Y, this.yawVelocity * safeDt);\\n    _qPitch.setFromAxisAngle(_AXIS_X, this.pitchVelocity * safeDt);\\n    _qRoll.setFromAxisAngle(_AXIS_Z, this.rollVelocity * safeDt);\\n\\n    this.quaternion.multiply(_qYaw);\\n    this.quaternion.multiply(_qPitch);\\n    this.quaternion.multiply(_qRoll);\\n    this.quaternion.normalize();\\n\\n    // Subtle visual bank when yawing without overriding deliberate A/D roll\\n    const targetBank = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(\\n      (this.yawVelocity / profile.yawSpeed) * profile.visualBankStrength,\\n      -0.42,\\n      0.42,\\n    );\\n    this.visualBankAngle = THREE.MathUtils.damp(this.visualBankAngle, targetBank, 6.5, safeDt);\\n\\n    // 4. Boost energy management\\n    if (this.boostLockedOut && this.boostEnergy >= 18) {\\n      this.boostLockedOut = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    const wantsBoost = input.boost && !input.backward && !this.boostLockedOut && this.boostEnergy > 0.5;\\n    const isBoosting = wantsBoost;\\n    this.boostJustEngaged = isBoosting && !this.wasBoosting;\\n    this.wasBoosting = isBoosting;\\n\\n    if (isBoosting) {\\n      this.boostEnergy = Math.max(0, this.boostEnergy - profile.boostDrainRate * safeDt);\\n      this.boostCooldownTimer = profile.boostRegenDelay;\\n      if (this.boostEnergy <= 0.1) {\\n        this.boostEnergy = 0;\\n        this.boostLockedOut = true;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      if (this.boostCooldownTimer > 0) {\\n        this.boostCooldownTimer = Math.max(0, this.boostCooldownTimer - safeDt);\\n      } else if (this.boostEnergy < profile.maxBoostEnergy) {\\n        this.boostEnergy = Math.min(\\n          profile.maxBoostEnergy,\\n          this.boostEnergy + profile.boostRegenRate * safeDt,\\n        );\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    this.boostIntensity = THREE.MathUtils.damp(\\n      this.boostIntensity,\\n      isBoosting ? 1 : 0,\\n      isBoosting ? 9.0 : 5.5,\\n      safeDt,\\n    );\\n\\n    // 5. Linear thrust, controlled arcade inertia, and lateral redirection\\n    _forwardWorld.copy(_FORWARD_LOCAL).applyQuaternion(this.quaternion).normalize();\\n    _rightWorld.copy(_AXIS_X).applyQuaternion(this.quaternion).normalize();\\n    _upWorld.copy(_AXIS_Y).applyQuaternion(this.quaternion).normalize();\\n\\n    const currentForwardSpeed = this.velocity.dot(_forwardWorld);\\n    const effectiveMaxSpeed = isBoosting\\n      ? profile.maxSpeed * profile.boostMultiplier\\n      : profile.maxSpeed;\\n\\n    let nextForwardSpeed = currentForwardSpeed;\\n    let throttle = 0;\\n\\n    if (isBoosting) {\\n      throttle = 1;\\n      const boostAccel = profile.acceleration * profile.boostAccelMultiplier;\\n      nextForwardSpeed = Math.min(effectiveMaxSpeed, currentForwardSpeed + boostAccel * safeDt);\\n    } else if (input.forward && !input.backward) {\\n      throttle = 1;\\n      if (currentForwardSpeed > profile.maxSpeed) {\\n        // Smooth bleed-down after releasing boost\\n        nextForwardSpeed = THREE.MathUtils.damp(currentForwardSpeed, profile.maxSpeed, 2.2, safeDt);\\n      } else {\\n        nextForwardSpeed = Math.min(\\n          profile.maxSpeed,\\n          currentForwardSpeed + profile.acceleration * safeDt,\\n        );\\n      }\\n    } else if (input.backward && !input.forward) {\\n      throttle = -1;\\n      nextForwardSpeed = Math.max(\\n        -profile.maxReverseSpeed,\\n        currentForwardSpeed - profile.deceleration * safeDt,\\n      );\\n    } else {\\n      // Controlled space inertia: gradual drag while preserving fast glide sensation\\n      const dragFactor = Math.exp(-profile.passiveDrag * safeDt);\\n      nextForwardSpeed = currentForwardSpeed * dragFactor;\\n      if (Math.abs(nextForwardSpeed) < 0.15) nextForwardSpeed = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Redirect existing velocity smoothly toward the ship\'s new facing direction\\n    // (gives tight arcade cornering with subtle, satisfying drift momentum)\\n    _desiredVel.copy(_forwardWorld).multiplyScalar(nextForwardSpeed);\\n    const gripLambda = isBoosting ? profile.lateralGrip * 1.45 : profile.lateralGrip;\\n    const gripAlpha = 1 - Math.exp(-gripLambda * safeDt);\\n    this.velocity.lerp(_desiredVel, gripAlpha);\\n\\n    // Ensure forward speed component tracks target thrust immediately without lag\\n    const updatedForward = this.velocity.dot(_forwardWorld);\\n    this.velocity.addScaledVector(_forwardWorld, nextForwardSpeed - updatedForward);\\n\\n    // Integrate world position\\n    this.position.addScaledVector(this.velocity, safeDt);\\n\\n    // 6. Populate live HUD telemetry (in-place mutation, zero allocations)\\n    const speedMag = this.velocity.length();\\n    const signedSpeed = this.velocity.dot(_forwardWorld);\\n\\n    _euler.setFromQuaternion(this.quaternion, \'YXZ\');\\n    let headingDeg = THREE.MathUtils.radToDeg(-_euler.y) % 360;\\n    if (headingDeg < 0) headingDeg += 360;\\n\\n    let status: FlightStatus = \'DRIFTING\';\\n    if (this.boostLockedOut && input.boost) {\\n      status = \'BOOST DEPLETED\';\\n    } else if (isBoosting) {\\n      status = \'BOOSTING\';\\n    } else if (signedSpeed < -2.5) {\\n      status = \'REVERSING\';\\n    } else if (input.forward) {\\n      status = speedMag > profile.maxSpeed * 0.9 ? \'CRUISING\' : \'ACCELERATING\';\\n    } else if (speedMag < 2) {\\n      status = \'STANDBY\';\\n    } else {\\n      status = \'DRIFTING\';\\n    }\\n\\n    telemetry.speed = speedMag;\\n    telemetry.signedSpeed = signedSpeed;\\n    telemetry.maxSpeed = profile.maxSpeed;\\n    telemetry.effectiveMaxSpeed = effectiveMaxSpeed;\\n    telemetry.throttle = throttle;\\n    telemetry.boostEnergy = this.boostEnergy;\\n    telemetry.maxBoostEnergy = profile.maxBoostEnergy;\\n    telemetry.isBoosting = isBoosting;\\n    telemetry.boostDepleted = this.boostLockedOut;\\n    telemetry.boostIntensity = this.boostIntensity;\\n    telemetry.hull = this.hull;\\n    telemetry.maxHull = this.ship.maxHull;\\n    telemetry.yawRate = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(this.yawVelocity / profile.yawSpeed, -1, 1);\\n    telemetry.pitchRate = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(this.pitchVelocity / profile.pitchSpeed, -1, 1);\\n    telemetry.rollRate = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(this.rollVelocity / profile.rollSpeed, -1, 1);\\n    telemetry.headingDeg = headingDeg;\\n    telemetry.pitchDeg = THREE.MathUtils.radToDeg(_euler.x);\\n    telemetry.rollDeg = THREE.MathUtils.radToDeg(_euler.z);\\n    telemetry.altitude = this.position.y;\\n    telemetry.status = status;\\n    telemetry.pointerLocked = input.pointerLocked;\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement 6DOF arcade space FlightController with quaternion orientation, boost energy mechanics, and zero-allocation telemetry updates\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/engine/FlightController.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating FlightController\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/engine/FlightController.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\207*\n\204*\001i\024}\023\224Z\354\022\334!\276J\355\b\213\362\243nc\364b\361\354\237\270j\305\bz\310E\346wF\275\236\365\370\276/\3273\224\037\361\026(h\260#3M\020z\227>\254z\206\tY\365\200\242A\256z\335w\266\332Vd\006xU\'\201\311\252-CXd\335\233\340\'\342\032\214\020H\311\313\216\255\227\243\302D)\235k~\305\305\250YE\230B\3667\025/\005eN\027\324jk|tj\373\266\332&7\265\"\324\f\327\244h\247\343\366r\255\'\235GK\236\204G\347ox\202\r5\a\212\032=\355G6\037\322\310\311\006\260v7\236X\205\3759;\337\262\206D\023\a\270\367\2537\033D\337\312m\235\313\230\337\v\363\212;\206[\220\304A1A\203|\240$\225e\000\230\301;|s\247\f\003\311T\326\002\022\203\340\252\342\240z}|\217\361KR\205\316\"0\302\253\314\3211\371\226\221\200\200\366\270\345#D^\251\367l\233\021\\\214Z\300U\270\356\243\373\v\251g\240\310\0330e ?k\305x@\"\221\340\216\222\231\237\030\'\222\0360\206\353\247\363\037\244\3421r\222R\211m\333w\253\2558\3047d\tdt\336\2464\2706f\312UT\275T+h\304\212\"\231\334\021\210*\020\320\266\217\304\317\235\212j\311\024\322\211\211ho\240\212Q\345\r\337\264R\372\225\3644\036,\a\304\b8\335\r\a\333\334\316\277\312\310\301`\026)\224\252\213\210\302\352\225U\301\036i\345\356U\267\317\372I\260\005\236\r\003\320\262\274N\270g!\214\333u\244\260\037\320sIC\223\212&Ca-\252\343\244\310\301\373\273qp\035\r\227\316\352s\0043\274c\230DrJI\033\265\214G\001\275`U\376\337-+a\204\312G[\212X\353/`g\221j)\253\221\333Ycu\037\363\321\352\235\004\266\020\230w9m\'\314L_%\346\225\233\232\025B\002N/\256o\277\273\314\346\376\321h\017\355\301TE\334\037<\212\2740,\023\271\361\2331\252|\236\200\3410\226(\323n\230\343(\350g\255\322G\177y=\373rf\375\302\017<3\244q\213\004\031\026<\324\312>@\020\211S\016\021\254mx\252POV\003\251\310p\3513\213\f+\266\264\\\002?\365\341\246\342\326\336\001_\245\037#\264\315\ryR17\230O\244F,\200\242z%\0171{\371\202\021\017T]\036~\343\037\037&\250\227\245\336@\307\203\342\004I\324\206_Q\330\355\034\307\220\330D\b\216V\261\020\357\224\341\f\0366$\367\245W%\343\fZ\300\243\352\371\325\030hu\307:\306\217\247<\201\354v\362w\267\245\243\023YJi\267\337,\251-\200\206IJ5#\031?\250\322\213\326\227\\\203A\260\201v\016\222\f\223xzx\301:\033\233\362\270>\203\037&\351\210jDW\316Qak(0\334S\224=\'\310\261\377\364j\200a\360\320$d\226\322cx\022r\333\342\201\202\320\305;J\037\252\207\367\275\203\343LK\201|\302\353\200\3144\017K-Q\235\311i\224\274\344\240\032\274Of\352\017I\v\235{\365.\352\264\343\204\337K\234\'\356t\216:\217J\255\341 \325\246H\374Xg\035\234\031\253\"\031t\'\226\366tFa\242j?\266xdj\354\016\372#\006w\276\326\214\310\200*-2Y\276\035\336\270\351>\233\300I\222\343!\350\215\323]\242\224\3667\313\003\363\375\026\347\310\225\240\242\033X\334\237\267\205C^\002zr56u;\234\306\337\022y\224\235\003F\023\345*1\r\367\363\312j\255\3501\224\212[F0X\311j\227;\335x\202\346\214f\036\3111\000\236\006l\213\305\247l\320\266*\242\214\206\3234y\\`\352\t\300\362q\r\355\311\036\272<\177<\273]\3427\001\363[#\367\210\340\366q\021k\v`?\241\243T\253 \023]q\333\305IF\v\312\263\b\317uS\234\277\360\301\336\'\277zS=e:d\225\332\226\206x\353\245n\'j\255\364\032\335\353:>@\006\351\324\324\025\325g\377\031\026~o9:\307e\"\305\377=\2357\355\217\263\315\266\310\211\231\035N\277\272\252\304n\274\303\230\374\322oa\331\335<U\235\036\033\221\346\016%r\'zw\002\240\234\3544\266\342\223u\327\002\027\024\3547\232&I\3115-\020\320\016\346\315\203H\232\377\016V\355\035^\024{\366\226!\242\025\274\264\335\256\2028\235G\"g\233!\035g\020~\261?\020\317\3212\324\317\276\260{\342\265Hv#\275\256y\263\275n\212\367\243\212\215\216\ty\350\304\214~M\265\346\224b\2759\373\341\327\311/\035hF\321AG\253\346\v\341\311\\\317\370\263\214\237\232\306\314{\037Z\030\270^\370\226<\227\300@)\357U\034Auyj\240\325\250^\216\004=\334\0318O\364\0016\226trDo\t\213\307\217[#\315\313xvP\005\307\t\373\367C\366\233VG2`\274\202 \2170p)<\356\312\223\335\tv\303\337\354\230\251\3007\255\260\354f\257\372M\266\231\317\275JZ\354E\2563\224\216\250\024\n\217\321\342\001\177;\005l\026\275OQ\346/\253\v\026\334\357\"37\307\333K\317\316G\314\334\251\235[\v\024\017\352}#\362\363\250\346\006\373\334\035-\fe\v8\222Y\326b\312]\020N\3613\b\367\361q\032\r\bm\224\352\035\371\a\333\abD\\\257\017\235\247\0211\271\346rK\317h_\363\363\300F4\207]i4u\361\213\000\b\273 #\333=\017\225\026\a\316\304\277\3234E}\204\330\2609\320\201I\375!E\023J\"\034{\266%\301\203k\234\246l\237\265\230[nWe\275]k\252;\3749=\317\243\322\370\254\374,\2034Cr\232\211\322\tHqm\200\0066|\227\377F*\251\345\302\263\210\002\362\256<[\256\247\251E\264\370\333.-874n%\r#\037Gp\235\f\245\177\001\363C#\004\3733:\267m\313AP>\342\003\372\367\272\312\177\217\031\334\273\233\320\344\017\217\000\213\344A\227v\032U\r\270\376\225\2453\266\354R\231J9\374-\357ewc\a\345\230\v\323\353Xu\225\227\372r\335\326b\2168\006/\025N}$V_\314\222H\214j\336\341\035\257\235\217#~}\246\261\312|\263\005\315F\365\202dS\337\'\363*jZS?\352\270\032\362\016\202\243t\322\310iy>\251\322n\265\375\310?\322\242\344N\230w%\204\366\335\004\307\231\223+}6\347\3746\005\021\212\207\203\344\245\220q\246D\202\035Jl\rV+\b\374F\357_\000\345\016I\"\272\355\230)\351Y\212\370)\242w\v\311I\'\315\362\302\350\003\340\216@\by\352\262\326\230\357U\207\321\267\314~\023\255\306\375\020\244wB\326\321\226s\300\305\345\3746\315\302\027CRlk\375\246\347\371\300n\023@,\2758\271\362F\021\344$7`\236\247OLg\242\214\326\375d\353k\204\321@\311\366R\f:\033\375\303g^\2236\217\276\226\306\200\320\303\360?e\333\020u\250A*\231\201=5\0332\373\345\024\220[\267\375i\344r\313N\035+\300.\234\323\036b\227\241\353b\037r\321\215\274\242\030\272DFt\2359\270ka.\3040U\037\'Q9x\016M\223\240n\026\003.\330v\371j,\006\212\n\264(\370r\371\247\026\300q\326\244\204m\233\214UT\200\206\311\346#\307\231a\032\031\235\321\003\020f\360\315\212\202\256\aN\370\305\301\237\037\t\320\255o\261\236\302xa\327\244L\361\307\223\220_\345f\353F\\\233\367s9,\324\316\352\251\264\267\244\213m\006}\026;\005T\323\310\313\243o\2029O\036\256I\341\324\0178\204\221\344}\216\207\332\215D\303\255Q\016J\n3D\272\215aw\0019m\356\263\254dWPq=s\306\375\307\264M\306\345\357E\"P{\"\r\313jGZM+\337Kt\273\023F9\2454\nk6%3\310*\026\255\264\3113<*\266\324\242\257JA\371\020\326\353R\241W\243)B\254~\231\033\016z\251g\236\325\226\352\375\365\214\a\256S\374\343e\361[\245\251OAL\245\214\242=\267\317\277\241\254\211\025d\251\371C\326\302\207\363\367\267\340\226&j\330-X\204A<.+\302\347]tu7:\314=\177+\377\307\004\316?\203\206\360S\303\027(!\320\220\211\353\216c\313W\302\000\345\216\274\206\3014\232\203O\300\227\'\334J\253\243O\031]F\226\343\330\222\264\017C\255}^$0\212\204\034\316\347TH\276$\021\324\310k\337a?\352\316\n\257\211\274.\205f\004\320\2125_\350`\252\250Q\373wg\277\262\201\016\030\213\a~;\v&\200\275]\371\v_g\b\b6\341#h\323\035\255j\371\361f_\253\037\371]\030\356e\224\221V\021\216\004\215 \3315b\270\342\337\344\350\ad\356\232\2574\v\333\034r\037%X\255\374O\212\2672+9\376\2618\035\363\033\207\3776\f\2120&\251ud\332\210{\246 \364\355w\302\224D\335R(\325\235\212\230\236\334\347\371\217\004SI\350\352S\265g5\033&\352k\2656\206\\\f\303\314\375\213\000\224\271|\331\331\006,\230Lb|\307\350=U\353\214\371=\314\305\351RY\272\337\003`\361\256v\271\362Z\362\017H\206\274\005\032\373\200\rx\324\225\376\333\\2\031\304\025c\006\f\266U\177\304\376\276\270\246\212\211\000\337\343\213\317/\324\341\276\003\216\332]\204\314F\363\331\250\305\241\207k\303\322\221i\250n\203\364\030\000\017_\227#\224\003\263\313+g\021|P~26y\213G6\302\370\023\346\274\005\340`\374w\212e=\2358\315\200\000uRl]\224\207\212{\333\260)\233\354\343\236\361&\v\356!mr\266\246.\200\375\004~L\343\307\232\255\3262e\0170D\257\242\247f1S\263\313m<\220\215\212\316\025Y3\\\016T\277\355;\365\275:I\301B\327\235\204l\217\033\204\252\224\241\255n\311\356\020\256\377\211H$R\033\213\246\361uc\232\004\214%UNvk\251\205\203\220r\0229\024j\v\357\230\300O\243\036\245\253\236\234\373\220\3550\271\311b\241\255@\337b(\005z\236\353\351\252\307b\005\232\225f\322\257\236y=\005k\356]1\304x\317m \244\241\317\350\277#\227\017\277\276\344\204p\211\0057?fe&\267\033\353\263\364\036\254\301n\034\ac\366