  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Cosmic Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the parallel construction of 3D scene elements. I\'m starting with `/src/scene/SpaceEnvironment.tsx`, which includes a procedural nebula skybox using GLSL FBM for cosmic cloud effects, a twinkling starfield that follows the camera to simulate infinite space, and a large ringed planet, tentatively named \"Aurelia Prime.\"\n\n\n**Expanding Scene Elements**\n\nI\'ve expanded the Aurelia Prime scene element with a Fresnel halo, procedurally banded rings, and a cratered moon. I\'m also adding an asteroid belt, navigation beacons, and refined space lighting, all aimed at a cinematic gleam using `RoomEnvironment`.  I\'m now writing the other scenes concurrently, including the zero-allocation speed lines, and dynamic boost warps. The goal is to build these pieces in parallel.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "mwX_aqXoCLXMvdIPob6H-Ag"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4420484344710918176"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { useFrame, useThree } from \'@react-three/fiber\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from \'three/examples/jsm/environments/RoomEnvironment.js\';\\nimport type { GraphicsPreset } from \'../config/graphics\';\\nimport { AssetManager } from \'../engine/AssetManager\';\\n\\nconst NEBULA_VERTEX = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec3 vDir;\\n  void main() {\\n    vDir = normalize(position);\\n    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst NEBULA_FRAGMENT = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec3 vDir;\\n  uniform float uTime;\\n\\n  float hash(vec3 p) {\\n    p = fract(p * 0.3183099 + 0.1);\\n    p *= 17.0;\\n    return fract(p.x * p.y * p.z * (p.x + p.y + p.z));\\n  }\\n\\n  float noise(vec3 x) {\\n    vec3 i = floor(x);\\n    vec3 f = fract(x);\\n    f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\\n\\n    return mix(\\n      mix(\\n        mix(hash(i + vec3(0,0,0)), hash(i + vec3(1,0,0)), f.x),\\n        mix(hash(i + vec3(0,1,0)), hash(i + vec3(1,1,0)), f.x),\\n        f.y\\n      ),\\n      mix(\\n        mix(hash(i + vec3(0,0,1)), hash(i + vec3(1,0,1)), f.x),\\n        mix(hash(i + vec3(0,1,1)), hash(i + vec3(1,1,1)), f.x),\\n        f.y\\n      ),\\n      f.z\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  float fbm(vec3 p) {\\n    float v = 0.0;\\n    float a = 0.52;\\n    for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      v += a * noise(p);\\n      p = p * 2.04 + vec3(13.1, 7.7, 5.3);\\n      a *= 0.5;\\n    }\\n    return v;\\n  }\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    vec3 d = normalize(vDir);\\n\\n    // Galactic plane tilted softly across the sky\\n    float plane = exp(-abs(d.y * 2.4 + d.x * 0.65) * 2.2);\\n\\n    float n1 = fbm(d * 2.6 + vec3(0.0, uTime * 0.004, 0.0));\\n    float n2 = fbm(d * 5.4 - vec3(uTime * 0.003, 1.2, 2.5));\\n    float filament = smoothstep(0.42, 0.86, n1 * 0.72 + n2 * 0.38);\\n\\n    // Deep navy void -> cobalt nebula -> electric cyan ionized edge\\n    vec3 voidCol = vec3(0.012, 0.024, 0.058);\\n    vec3 navyNebula = vec3(0.032, 0.088, 0.215);\\n    vec3 indigoDust = vec3(0.075, 0.062, 0.205);\\n    vec3 cyanIon = vec3(0.045, 0.42, 0.64);\\n\\n    vec3 col = voidCol;\\n    col = mix(col, navyNebula, smoothstep(0.28, 0.75, n1) * (0.45 + 0.55 * plane));\\n    col += indigoDust * smoothstep(0.5, 0.9, n2) * 0.38 * plane;\\n    col += cyanIon * filament * plane * 0.44;\\n\\n    // Distant blue-white sun corona glow on upper-right horizon\\n    vec3 sunDir = normalize(vec3(0.58, 0.32, -0.74));\\n    float sunDot = max(dot(d, sunDir), 0.0);\\n    col += vec3(0.42, 0.78, 1.0) * pow(sunDot, 16.0) * 0.38;\\n    col += vec3(0.95, 0.98, 1.0) * pow(sunDot, 220.0) * 1.1;\\n\\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst ATMOSPHERE_VERTEX = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec3 vNormalWorld;\\n  varying vec3 vViewDir;\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    vec4 worldPos = modelMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\\n    vNormalWorld = normalize(mat3(modelMatrix) * normal);\\n    vViewDir = normalize(cameraPosition - worldPos.xyz);\\n    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * viewMatrix * worldPos;\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst ATMOSPHERE_FRAGMENT = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec3 vNormalWorld;\\n  varying vec3 vViewDir;\\n  uniform vec3 uColor;\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    float rim = 1.0 - max(dot(vNormalWorld, vViewDir), 0.0);\\n    float glow = pow(rim, 3.2);\\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(uColor * 1.35, glow * 0.78);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst RING_VERTEX = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec2 vUv;\\n  void main() {\\n    vUv = uv;\\n    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst RING_FRAGMENT = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec2 vUv;\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    vec2 centered = vUv * 2.0 - 1.0;\\n    float r = length(centered);\\n    if (r < 0.46 || r > 0.98) discard;\\n\\n    float t = (r - 0.46) / 0.52;\\n    float bands = 0.55 + 0.45 * sin(t * 58.0) * cos(t * 21.0 + 0.6);\\n    float cassiniGap = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.61, 0.64, t) * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.68, 0.71, t));\\n    float edgeFade = smoothstep(0.0, 0.09, t) * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.88, 1.0, t));\\n\\n    vec3 innerCol = vec3(0.32, 0.58, 0.82);\\n    vec3 outerCol = vec3(0.14, 0.28, 0.48);\\n    vec3 col = mix(innerCol, outerCol, t);\\n    float alpha = bands * cassiniGap * edgeFade * 0.58;\\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(col, alpha);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst STAR_VERTEX = /* glsl */ `\\n  attribute float aSize;\\n  attribute float aPhase;\\n  varying vec3 vColor;\\n  varying float vTwinkle;\\n  uniform float uTime;\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    vColor = color;\\n    vTwinkle = 0.74 + 0.26 * sin(uTime * 1.8 + aPhase);\\n    vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\\n    gl_PointSize = clamp(aSize * (340.0 / max(-mvPosition.z, 1.0)), 1.2, 6.5);\\n    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\nconst STAR_FRAGMENT = /* glsl */ `\\n  varying vec3 vColor;\\n  varying float vTwinkle;\\n\\n  void main() {\\n    vec2 c = gl_PointCoord - 0.5;\\n    float d = length(c) * 2.0;\\n    if (d > 1.0) discard;\\n    float core = pow(1.0 - d, 2.2);\\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(vColor * (1.15 * vTwinkle), core);\\n  }\\n`;\\n\\ninterface SpaceEnvironmentProps {\\n  graphics: GraphicsPreset;\\n}\\n\\nconst _dummy = new THREE.Object3D();\\n\\nexport function SpaceEnvironment({ graphics }: SpaceEnvironmentProps) {\\n  const { gl, scene, camera } = useThree();\\n  const skyboxRef = useRef<THREE.Mesh>(null);\\n  const starGroupRef = useRef<THREE.Points>(null);\\n  const gasGiantRef = useRef<THREE.Group>(null);\\n  const moonRef = useRef<THREE.Mesh>(null);\\n  const asteroidsRef = useRef<THREE.InstancedMesh>(null);\\n\\n  // Configure procedural studio RoomEnvironment IBL so metallic PBR ships catch realistic reflections\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    AssetManager.configureRenderer(gl);\\n    const pmrem = new THREE.PMREMGenerator(gl);\\n    const envTarget = pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(), 0.04);\\n    scene.environment = envTarget.texture;\\n    scene.background = new THREE.Color(\'#030712\');\\n    scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(\'#040a18\', 0.00028);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      scene.environment = null;\\n      envTarget.dispose();\\n      pmrem.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, [gl, scene]);\\n\\n  const textures = useMemo(() => AssetManager.getCoreTextures(), []);\\n\\n  // Nebula skybox shader material\\n  const nebulaMat = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n        uniforms: { uTime: { value: 0 } },\\n        vertexShader: NEBULA_VERTEX,\\n        fragmentShader: NEBULA_FRAGMENT,\\n        side: THREE.BackSide,\\n        depthWrite: false,\\n      }),\\n    [],\\n  );\\n\\n  // Planet atmosphere & ring shaders\\n  const atmosphereMat = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n        uniforms: { uColor: { value: new THREE.Color(\'#38bdf8\') } },\\n        vertexShader: ATMOSPHERE_VERTEX,\\n        fragmentShader: ATMOSPHERE_FRAGMENT,\\n        transparent: true,\\n        depthWrite: false,\\n        blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\\n        side: THREE.FrontSide,\\n      }),\\n    [],\\n  );\\n\\n  const ringMat = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n        vertexShader: RING_VERTEX,\\n        fragmentShader: RING_FRAGMENT,\\n        transparent: true,\\n        depthWrite: false,\\n        side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n      }),\\n    [],\\n  );\\n\\n  // Procedural multi-spectral starfield\\n  const { starGeo, starMat } = useMemo(() => {\\n    const count = graphics.starCount;\\n    const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\\n    const colors = new Float32Array(count * 3);\\n    const sizes = new Float32Array(count);\\n    const phases = new Float32Array(count);\\n    const palette = [\\n      new THREE.Color(\'#e0f2fe\'),\\n      new THREE.Color(\'#bae6fd\'),\\n      new THREE.Color(\'#f8fafc\'),\\n      new THREE.Color(\'#93c5fd\'),\\n      new THREE.Color(\'#fef3c7\'),\\n    ];\\n\\n    let seed = 42019;\\n    const rand = () => {\\n      seed = (seed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n      return seed / 4294967296;\\n    };\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n      // Uniform spherical shell at distant radius\\n      const u = rand() * 2 - 1;\\n      const theta = rand() * Math.PI * 2;\\n      const sqrtOneMinusU2 = Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, 1 - u * u));\\n      const radius = 1400 + rand() * 1400;\\n\\n      positions[i * 3] = radius * sqrtOneMinusU2 * Math.cos(theta);\\n      positions[i * 3 + 1] = radius * u;\\n      positions[i * 3 + 2] = radius * sqrtOneMinusU2 * Math.sin(theta);\\n\\n      const col = palette[Math.floor(rand() * palette.length)];\\n      colors[i * 3] = col.r;\\n      colors[i * 3 + 1] = col.g;\\n      colors[i * 3 + 2] = col.b;\\n\\n      sizes[i] = 1.4 + Math.pow(rand(), 3.2) * 5.2;\\n      phases[i] = rand() * Math.PI * 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    const geo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\\n    geo.setAttribute(\'position\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\\n    geo.setAttribute(\'color\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors, 3));\\n    geo.setAttribute(\'aSize\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(sizes, 1));\\n    geo.setAttribute(\'aPhase\', new THREE.BufferAttribute(phases, 1));\\n\\n    const mat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\\n      uniforms: { uTime: { value: 0 } },\\n      vertexShader: STAR_VERTEX,\\n      fragmentShader: STAR_FRAGMENT,\\n      vertexColors: true,\\n      transparent: true,\\n      depthWrite: false,\\n      blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\\n    });\\n\\n    return { starGeo: geo, starMat: mat };\\n  }, [graphics.starCount]);\\n\\n  // Sculpted procedural asteroid geometry for InstancedMesh orbital belt\\n  const asteroidGeo = useMemo(() => {\\n    const geo = new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(1, 1);\\n    const pos = geo.attributes.position;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pos.count; i++) {\\n      const x = pos.getX(i);\\n      const y = pos.getY(i);\\n      const z = pos.getZ(i);\\n      const disp =\\n        0.82 +\\n        0.18 * Math.sin(x * 3.7 + y * 2.1) +\\n        0.14 * Math.cos(z * 4.3 - x * 2.9);\\n      pos.setXYZ(i, x * disp, y * disp * 0.86, z * disp);\\n    }\\n    geo.computeVertexNormals();\\n    return geo;\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const asteroidMat = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n        map: textures.asteroidMap,\\n        color: \'#94a3b8\',\\n        roughness: 0.88,\\n        metalness: 0.14,\\n      }),\\n    [textures.asteroidMap],\\n  );\\n\\n  // Orbital sector beacons for crisp visual scale & spatial orientation\\n  const beacons = useMemo(() => {\\n    return [\\n      { pos: [0, 8, -140] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.0 },\\n      { pos: [145, 28, -320] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.2 },\\n      { pos: [-170, -18, -460] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.15 },\\n      { pos: [70, 52, -720] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.3 },\\n      { pos: [-240, 14, -180] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.0 },\\n      { pos: [280, -34, -110] as [number, number, number], scale: 1.1 },\\n    ];\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Populate instanced asteroid field with deterministic layout leaving clear flight corridor around spawn\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const mesh = asteroidsRef.current;\\n    if (!mesh) return;\\n\\n    let seed = 88123;\\n    const rand = () => {\\n      seed = (seed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n      return seed / 4294967296;\\n    };\\n\\n    const tint = new THREE.Color();\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < graphics.asteroidCount; i++) {\\n      // Distribute in an expansive ring/corridor across the orbital sector\\n      const angle = rand() * Math.PI * 2;\\n      const dist = 75 + rand() * 820;\\n      const x = Math.cos(angle) * dist;\\n      const z = Math.sin(angle) * dist - 220;\\n      const y = (rand() - 0.5) * 260;\\n\\n      // Keep spawn corridor cleanly navigable\\n      if (Math.hypot(x, y - 12, z - 40) < 62) {\\n        _dummy.position.set(x + 95, y + 35, z - 85);\\n      } else {\\n        _dummy.position.set(x, y, z);\\n      }\\n\\n      const scale = 1.6 + Math.pow(rand(), 2.2) * 16.5;\\n      _dummy.scale.set(\\n        scale * (0.85 + rand() * 0.35),\\n        scale * (0.75 + rand() * 0.35),\\n        scale * (0.85 + rand() * 0.35),\\n      );\\n      _dummy.rotation.set(rand() * Math.PI, rand() * Math.PI, rand() * Math.PI);\\n      _dummy.updateMatrix();\\n      mesh.setMatrixAt(i, _dummy.matrix);\\n\\n      const luma = 0.42 + rand() * 0.32;\\n      tint.setRGB(luma * 0.88, luma * 0.94, luma * 1.06);\\n      mesh.setColorAt(i, tint);\\n    }\\n    mesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n    if (mesh.instanceColor) mesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate = true;\\n    mesh.computeBoundingSphere();\\n  }, [graphics.asteroidCount]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      nebulaMat.dispose();\\n      atmosphereMat.dispose();\\n      ringMat.dispose();\\n      starGeo.dispose();\\n      starMat.dispose();\\n      asteroidGeo.dispose();\\n      asteroidMat.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, [nebulaMat, atmosphereMat, ringMat, starGeo, starMat, asteroidGeo, asteroidMat]);\\n\\n  useFrame((state, delta) => {\\n    const dt = Math.min(delta, 0.05);\\n    const t = state.clock.elapsedTime;\\n    nebulaMat.uniforms.uTime.value = t;\\n    starMat.uniforms.uTime.value = t;\\n\\n    // Anchor skybox & deep starfield to camera so space feels boundless in every direction\\n    if (skyboxRef.current) {\\n      skyboxRef.current.position.copy(camera.position);\\n    }\\n    if (starGroupRef.current) {\\n      starGroupRef.current.position.copy(camera.position);\\n    }\\n    if (gasGiantRef.current) {\\n      gasGiantRef.current.rotation.y += dt * 0.008;\\n    }\\n    if (moonRef.current) {\\n      moonRef.current.rotation.y += dt * 0.016;\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <group name=\\\"space-environment\\\">\\n      {/* Warm Solar Key Light + Cool Deep-Space Fill + Electric Cyan Rim Backlight */}\\n      <directionalLight\\n        position={[320, 190, -260]}\\n        intensity={2.6}\\n        color=\\\"#f8fafc\\\"\\n        castShadow={graphics.shadows}\\n        shadow-mapSize={[1024, 1024]}\\n        shadow-bias={-0.0005}\\n        shadow-normalBias={0.02}\\n      />\\n      <hemisphereLight args={[\'#38bdf8\', \'#090f24\', 0.85]} />\\n      <directionalLight position={[-180, -90, 220]} intensity={1.1} color=\\\"#0ea5e9\\\" />\\n\\n      {/* Procedural Deep-Space Nebula Skybox */}\\n      <mesh ref={skyboxRef} frustumCulled={false} renderOrder={-100}>\\n        <sphereGeometry args={[3200, 32, 24]} />\\n        <primitive object={nebulaMat} attach=\\\"material\\\" />\\n      </mesh>\\n\\n      {/* Multi-Spectral Twinkling Starfield */}\\n      <points ref={starGroupRef} geometry={starGeo} material={starMat} frustumCulled={false} />\\n\\n      {/* Primary Cinematic Gas Giant \\\"Aurelia Prime\\\" with Rings & Atmospheric Fresnel Halo */}\\n      <group position={[-480, 130, -1350]} rotation={[0.24, 0.35, -0.28]}>\\n        <group ref={gasGiantRef}>\\n          <mesh>\\n            <sphereGeometry args={[280, graphics.planetSegments, graphics.planetSegments]} />\\n            <meshStandardMaterial\\n              map={textures.gasGiantMap}\\n              roughness={0.82}\\n              metalness={0.06}\\n              envMapIntensity={0.4}\\n            />\\n          </mesh>\\n        </group>\\n\\n        {/* Fresnel Atmospheric Rim Shell */}\\n        <mesh scale={1.045}>\\n          <sphereGeometry args={[280, graphics.planetSegments, graphics.planetSegments]} />\\n          <primitive object={atmosphereMat} attach=\\\"material\\\" />\\n        </mesh>\\n\\n        {/* Tilted Planetary Ring System */}\\n        <mesh rotation={[Math.PI * 0.47, 0.1, 0]}>\\n          <planeGeometry args={[1240, 1240]} />\\n          <primitive object={ringMat} attach=\\\"material\\\" />\\n        </mesh>\\n      </group>\\n\\n      {/* Secondary Scarred Rocky Moon */}\\n      <mesh ref={moonRef} position={[620, -110, -920]}>\\n        <sphereGeometry args={[92, Math.max(24, graphics.planetSegments - 12), Math.max(24, graphics.planetSegments - 12)]} />\\n        <meshStandardMaterial\\n          map={textures.moonMap}\\n          roughness={0.92}\\n          metalness={0.08}\\n          envMapIntensity={0.35}\\n        />\\n      </mesh>\\n\\n      {/* Distant Warm Dwarf Star Accent */}\\n      <mesh position={[1200, 560, -1700]}>\\n        <sphereGeometry args={[32, 16, 16]} />\\n        <meshBasicMaterial color=\\\"#e0f2fe\\\" toneMapped={false} />\\n      </mesh>\\n\\n      {/* Instanced Asteroid Belt for Speed Parallax & Spatial Depth */}\\n      <instancedMesh\\n        ref={asteroidsRef}\\n        args={[asteroidGeo, asteroidMat, graphics.asteroidCount]}\\n        frustumCulled={false}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Orbital Navigation Relay Beacons (Visual Flight Corridor Landmarks) */}\\n      {beacons.map((b, idx) => (\\n        <group key={idx} position={b.pos} scale={b.scale}>\\n          <mesh rotation={[0, 0, Math.PI / 4]}>\\n            <torusGeometry args={[14, 0.55, 8, 28]} />\\n            <meshStandardMaterial\\n              color=\\\"#334155\\\"\\n              metalness={0.85}\\n              roughness={0.32}\\n            />\\n          </mesh>\\n          <mesh rotation={[0, 0, Math.PI / 4]}>\\n            <torusGeometry args={[12.8, 0.16, 6, 28]} />\\n            <meshStandardMaterial\\n              color=\\\"#22d3ee\\\"\\n              emissive=\\\"#06b6d4\\\"\\n              emissiveIntensity={1.6}\\n              toneMapped={false}\\n            />\\n          </mesh>\\n        </group>\\n      ))}\\n    </group>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create cinematic SpaceEnvironment with procedural GLSL nebula skybox, twinkling starfield, ringed gas giant, moon, instanced asteroids, beacons, and RoomEnvironment IBL\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scene/SpaceEnvironment.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating 3D space environment\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/scene/SpaceEnvironment.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\323\f\n\320\f\001i\024}\023y\335\272\375\3411C\037\276\005kT\311\243\201\311\000\035\325\021v\2463\020\247\332\321l+n\266\217\250 9\205\312\217\005\273(\346G\306\b\334\343H\265\241\324\214MaV\276\206NH\272\263\205I\324\370\315\372N,\267\373S\372\333\343\275}\304\376\351\346\214\346\224\320\t\345\\f\314\330\347o\343@SK\326\232\265\\A\264}\322,=\2125\244\350L\315\344*2\260k\332\333x\345\024!\373\002\000\215\372\243\001\033\005\230\301\3423\177\2202!\t\'\342\226\206V\277\313\'\027\3173\031~D\204x\217\340\242\372\215\022X\306}\324%\321\315\377\001\020\300\202\025\273\341\245S\004\315\356\313\367\"\233\312\306\321\336\321\217+\324\245\t\374f\242W\3609W\204\334%g].\251\322{6Yv\254Abzv\231\265\222>k\303C\223\016s\363\342W\275\317\346B\326\326\362.\345Nf\233u\261\336\022\203\237c5N\304\256\332\000\023\200|\361\025\363\272b7\331\315\000\321\025\333\n\261\214\260\0173+b\002\303H\213wN\264W\221\214S8wm\332\000\001\254\213\252\211\254M\264\031w\272\336\256xV\260p\rt\v&\032u\2405\321\276\212\214\213\2273\307\274\200t\374\342\305x\314C\226\213Wl1Z\201\334\334?&\376\343\024\261\362\206\374\274\337\355a\037c\253\315\377\035\025\275\314xG\232$NEz\242\000\250\277\376\211Y\336\026vJ\267\261i\217\3431\2259\311\324Ohv\351\327\0048\262\024\fDb\313\323\253r\016\231Y\t=\340\322\326,\n\037\242\363\367\374\366\266\237\031A\251\021<\303\376\t1\243\273l\364\237tO\363\246T\277U\326\270}\267l\231+\243+\323\337\272\036|\366 \301\366\234[\222\271\253\224.V\bv\241\226NsvU?p\333\213\260\0218\304\237]G\216\335$m|\004Q\352U\3031\r\347\314\375S\035\337#\374j\0202q]\3666~Ei\376\246\222\275\027\257\037\247\027RO+1\262\253{\307\276\215\355\317t\351\224\017\375oq\032hQIM\230\275F\247\266-\304\213ZAc\330#\372f\316\342py\303\370!\275*9\376\001:z\314`.\362\340\032\313\317\227@A\247\201\r\303\215\347K\240\362V\311[5\306\372S\006\310\327\002\242\002\256\265\301e\365z\352\272\003)\211\233\337\355T\351\325a\323\301n\207\242\305HS\au\fCV5%\334\252\230\f\3350L4Q\312a\333\266\n\336\315c\344aw\221\322\'\211\345z\203\225\237\243\306\347\203\320\304\n\311\242\312\005P\356\033\320\211\205\230\331\227~\340\373\263\263\033\233\241\240\n5\222~\221\240\376\200\035\354\241.e,\373k\365\017\036la\371\277\021\237 \033-Ti\337\365Y.XZ\004o\034x\035]\343\370\203\243%\032\211OR\344\026\301\000E\345$\343\347\'\246\266\026\310jV\270\343%\356\356\006:\224\203\'?\224\221\315z\322\325\035\312\225^9\272{88\270\367\231\254u\340\245\254\251\301\033\347\304\020*/\r\220\344g\v\316\345>\202\200w\256\242B\ru\231\032\3666\331y\025\215\254R\374uw\276\236\\\342\nlb\222\375\006\321\206a\2341\3478\224\324\037J\003\357\301\303F=\360\336\233\206\a\v\'\002s\316\aG\362\225C\225\304\317\036\315\266d\021\355\320\201\002\261OZ\226\221\224\207*.R\210H\352\200\216\235=\353\002\001\246\030\364\242\027\212\272\375\266l\305\301Uv\262\267\313\006\356E)\372\312\226Sk8,\300\027\217\330\260/\204j`\240W(FN\365\220\247\020/\326\266\356\225k_Z\b\247J\\\020s\337\332\206\2217\320[\243\275I\357qPN\340n\241\264C\323\311\277\303\001\026\322\260\225\305\025j\350\251\f\377pO\361dS\327{\242v\322\371\0209\362\301EkOa\005\210O\243\254k\374m\327I\327\250\0167Z\016~c\230hi\222\353#\211g\220\330v\213[\301\333\257w\273g\244k\232\267\326\b0W\034\210c\301L\237\351\320\271\343k\206\016\311\304!\020-\232!\001\337S5\357\227WY\214\341\361\360@\025\"\266^\244\317\323s\367\275\b\263s\t\'m\314\273\231\351MlHF\346\203\261(\220\3139)\2661\305\025\242\340\201]\226b\375\031\f\000HU\200\270\356\0018\246h\\\376T\031L\331\274sW\256\310]\324\035oz\020\221o\201\240\270E\205\231T\345\241\350~E8\201\263\'\247\033!\034@AQ:\223\374bH\316\205\033\017\375\332\\\217\026\3174\2244\226\275\0018,\333\216\327\022\203\361<\025+y\371\304\375>n\352}N\376\342\301\252nM\0244\262\033\374\037\0260\266\252\035_R\200\250\355^\b\301t\266t\016\227\332a\2344\303\244\232\327\322\326\225\026\366j:#\372#\345\006\213\200p\rW\313s\227\002\270\254\3408\245\315\207\223W|\350\027\263\376Y\177\303\237b\3666\b\037 \271\225\332\033\253\035\364\213\343\321`\v\361H7\360`\004\032\335\211(t\023\017\262<\257C\320{\t\256\'\2036\353\210va\252\020\201\247}\266V\035\352h\000\316Yr\023\340\304@8?<@%\234\263\351\006\306\366\224X\003\342c\231eW\273\373\021\352\262\264:](\362\022\300\317]<\202\254\344Q\376i\370\307\337\026\341\306\203\275\301\337\323\353\337\031\017\0216\254\266F\364\316_4\aR\237D\355\320z\352h\337\025|\253\037\030\251U\0031\333\366\200\355\016\311C\265\353\267\207\326\354y\334\207r\361X\231\346d\341D\347b\024R\305\300>Pk\242\a\325\266\342\256X\371\034,\233\324\035\000\233\0024\v\035\346\376\272j\240\'\311\235s\252B$\236\330m\036\321\242\271~\373\272zG\254\235[\'\003-\244dY\200{\322\247i\270\223#\207:\330\263\031\350\375\t\362\262\267\375\262\306\001\355\3631\304\304\313\023{\344\240\263U~\202\201[W$\255\312\215"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4420484344710921125"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { useFrame } from \'@react-three/fiber\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport type { FlightController } from \'../engine/FlightController\';\\nimport type { FlightTelemetry } from \'../types/game\';\\n\\ninterface SpeedLinesVFXProps {\\n  flight: FlightController;\\n  telemetryRef: React.MutableRefObject<FlightTelemetry>;\\n  count: number;\\n  active: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nconst BOX_HALF = 58;\\nconst BOX_SIZE = BOX_HALF * 2;\\n\\nconst _dummy = new THREE.Object3D();\\nconst _velDir = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _upVec = new THREE.Vector3(0, 1, 0);\\nconst _quat = new THREE.Quaternion();\\nconst _baseColor = new THREE.Color(\'#7dd3fc\');\\nconst _boostColor = new THREE.Color(\'#e0f2fe\');\\n\\n/**\\n * Instanced space-dust streaks & boost warp speed-lines.\\n * Wraps seamlessly around the player ship with zero per-frame allocations.\\n */\\nexport function SpeedLinesVFX({ flight, telemetryRef, count, active }: SpeedLinesVFXProps) {\\n  const meshRef = useRef<THREE.InstancedMesh>(null);\\n\\n  const offsets = useMemo(() => {\\n    const arr = new Float32Array(count * 3);\\n    let seed = 13371;\\n    const rand = () => {\\n      seed = (seed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\\n      return seed / 4294967296;\\n    };\\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n      arr[i * 3] = (rand() - 0.5) * BOX_SIZE;\\n      arr[i * 3 + 1] = (rand() - 0.5) * BOX_SIZE;\\n      arr[i * 3 + 2] = (rand() - 0.5) * BOX_SIZE;\\n    }\\n    return arr;\\n  }, [count]);\\n\\n  const geo = useMemo(() => new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.032, 0.032, 1, 4, 1, true), []);\\n  const mat = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\\n        color: \'#7dd3fc\',\\n        transparent: true,\\n        opacity: 0.25,\\n        depthWrite: false,\\n        blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\\n      }),\\n    [],\\n  );\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      geo.dispose();\\n      mat.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, [geo, mat]);\\n\\n  useFrame(() => {\\n    const mesh = meshRef.current;\\n    if (!mesh) return;\\n\\n    if (!active) {\\n      mesh.visible = false;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const telemetry = telemetryRef.current;\\n    const speed = telemetry.speed;\\n    const boost = telemetry.boostIntensity;\\n\\n    if (speed < 4 && boost < 0.05) {\\n      mesh.visible = false;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    mesh.visible = true;\\n\\n    const speedRatio = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(speed / Math.max(telemetry.maxSpeed, 1), 0, 2);\\n    mat.opacity = THREE.MathUtils.clamp(0.08 + speedRatio * 0.22 + boost * 0.45, 0.05, 0.78);\\n    mat.color.copy(_baseColor).lerp(_boostColor, boost);\\n\\n    if (speed > 0.5) {\\n      _velDir.copy(flight.velocity).normalize();\\n    } else {\\n      _velDir.set(0, 0, -1).applyQuaternion(flight.quaternion).normalize();\\n    }\\n    _quat.setFromUnitVectors(_upVec, _velDir);\\n\\n    const streakLen = 0.65 + speedRatio * 2.8 + boost * 7.8;\\n    const streakThickness = 0.7 + boost * 0.65;\\n\\n    const px = flight.position.x;\\n    const py = flight.position.y;\\n    const pz = flight.position.z;\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n      const bx = offsets[i * 3];\\n      const by = offsets[i * 3 + 1];\\n      const bz = offsets[i * 3 + 2];\\n\\n      // Wrap world-space anchor points into a local cube centered around the ship\\n      const wx = px + ((((bx - px + BOX_HALF) % BOX_SIZE) + BOX_SIZE) % BOX_SIZE) - BOX_HALF;\\n      const wy = py + ((((by - py + BOX_HALF) % BOX_SIZE) + BOX_SIZE) % BOX_SIZE) - BOX_HALF;\\n      const wz = pz + ((((bz - pz + BOX_HALF) % BOX_SIZE) + BOX_SIZE) % BOX_SIZE) - BOX_HALF;\\n\\n      // Push particles slightly away from the immediate center cockpit corridor so they never clip the camera\\n      const dx = wx - px;\\n      const dy = wy - py;\\n      const dz = wz - pz;\\n      const distSq = dx * dx + dy * dy + dz * dz;\\n      if (distSq < 36) {\\n        _dummy.scale.set(0, 0, 0);\\n      } else {\\n        _dummy.position.set(wx, wy, wz);\\n        _dummy.quaternion.copy(_quat);\\n        _dummy.scale.set(streakThickness, streakLen, streakThickness);\\n      }\\n\\n      _dummy.updateMatrix();\\n      mesh.setMatrixAt(i, _dummy.matrix);\\n    }\\n\\n    mesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <instancedMesh\\n      ref={meshRef}\\n      args={[geo, mat, count]}\\n      frustumCulled={false}\\n      renderOrder={12}\\n    />\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create zero-allocation instanced SpeedLinesVFX component for space dust motion cues and boost warp lines\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scene/SpeedLinesVFX.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating speed-lines VFX\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/scene/SpeedLinesVFX.tsx\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4420484344710919978"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { useFrame, useThree } from \'@react-three/fiber\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { AudioManager } from \'../audio/AudioManager\';\\nimport type { GraphicsPreset } from \'../config/graphics\';\\nimport { SHIP_CONFIGS } from \'../config/ships\';\\nimport { CameraController } from \'../engine/CameraController\';\\nimport type { FlightController } from \'../engine/FlightController\';\\nimport type { InputManager } from \'../engine/InputManager\';\\nimport type {\\n  FlightTelemetry,\\n  GamePhase,\\n  GameSettings,\\n  MenuSection,\\n  ShipId,\\n} from \'../types/game\';\\nimport { buildShipModel } from \'./shipGeometry\';\\nimport { SpaceEnvironment } from \'./SpaceEnvironment\';\\nimport { SpeedLinesVFX } from \'./SpeedLinesVFX\';\\n\\ninterface GameSceneProps {\\n  phase: GamePhase;\\n  menuSection: MenuSection;\\n  activeShipId: ShipId;\\n  hangarShipId: ShipId;\\n  flight: FlightController;\\n  input: InputManager;\\n  settingsRef: React.MutableRefObject<GameSettings>;\\n  telemetryRef: React.MutableRefObject<FlightTelemetry>;\\n  graphics: GraphicsPreset;\\n  hangarOrbitRef: React.MutableRefObject<{ yaw: number; pitch: number }>;\\n  snapCameraSignal: number;\\n}\\n\\nconst _showcaseOrigin = new THREE.Vector3(0, 12, 40);\\n\\nexport function GameScene({\\n  phase,\\n  menuSection,\\n  activeShipId,\\n  hangarShipId,\\n  flight,\\n  input,\\n  settingsRef,\\n  telemetryRef,\\n  graphics,\\n  hangarOrbitRef,\\n  snapCameraSignal,\\n}: GameSceneProps) {\\n  const { camera, gl } = useThree();\\n  const shipRootRef = useRef<THREE.Group>(null);\\n  const shipBankRef = useRef<THREE.Group>(null);\\n  const cameraController = useMemo(() => new CameraController(), []);\\n\\n  // Display the inspected ship while in Hangar, otherwise the active flight ship\\n  const displayedShipId = phase === \'menu\' && menuSection === \'hangar\' ? hangarShipId : activeShipId;\\n  const displayedShipConfig = SHIP_CONFIGS[displayedShipId];\\n\\n  const shipHandle = useMemo(() => buildShipModel(displayedShipConfig), [displayedShipConfig]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      shipHandle.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, [shipHandle]);\\n\\n  // Snap chase camera cleanly when starting a new flight session\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (phase === \'playing\' && camera instanceof THREE.PerspectiveCamera) {\\n      cameraController.snapToShip(flight, camera, settingsRef.current.cameraDistance);\\n    }\\n  }, [snapCameraSignal, phase, camera, cameraController, flight, settingsRef]);\\n\\n  // Sync camera draw distance when graphics quality changes\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (camera instanceof THREE.PerspectiveCamera) {\\n      camera.far = graphics.drawDistance;\\n      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\\n    }\\n  }, [camera, graphics.drawDistance]);\\n\\n  // Lightweight rolling FPS / frame-time accumulator (writes to mutable telemetry ref)\\n  const perfRef = useRef({ frames: 0, elapsed: 0 });\\n\\n  useFrame((state, delta) => {\\n    const dt = Math.min(delta, 0.05);\\n    const telemetry = telemetryRef.current;\\n    const settings = settingsRef.current;\\n\\n    // Performance metrics update (every 250ms, zero React re-renders)\\n    perfRef.current.frames += 1;\\n    perfRef.current.elapsed += delta;\\n    if (perfRef.current.elapsed >= 0.25) {\\n      const avgFrameSec = perfRef.current.elapsed / perfRef.current.frames;\\n      telemetry.fps = Math.round(1 / Math.max(avgFrameSec, 0.001));\\n      telemetry.frameTimeMs = avgFrameSec * 1000;\\n      telemetry.drawCalls = gl.info.render.calls;\\n      telemetry.triangles = gl.info.render.triangles;\\n      perfRef.current.frames = 0;\\n      perfRef.current.elapsed = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (phase === \'playing\') {\\n      const snapshot = input.consumeSnapshot();\\n      flight.update(dt, snapshot, settings, telemetry);\\n\\n      if (flight.getBoostJustEngaged()) {\\n        AudioManager.playBoostEngage();\\n      }\\n\\n      if (shipRootRef.current) {\\n        shipRootRef.current.position.copy(flight.position);\\n        shipRootRef.current.quaternion.copy(flight.quaternion);\\n      }\\n      if (shipBankRef.current) {\\n        shipBankRef.current.rotation.set(0, 0, flight.visualBankAngle);\\n      }\\n\\n      const speedRatio = telemetry.speed / Math.max(telemetry.maxSpeed, 1);\\n      shipHandle.updateVisuals(\\n        dt,\\n        speedRatio,\\n        telemetry.boostIntensity,\\n        telemetry.yawRate,\\n        telemetry.pitchRate,\\n        telemetry.rollRate,\\n      );\\n\\n      AudioManager.updateFlightAudio(speedRatio, telemetry.boostIntensity, telemetry.throttle);\\n\\n      if (camera instanceof THREE.PerspectiveCamera) {\\n        cameraController.updateChase(\\n          dt,\\n          flight,\\n          camera,\\n          settings,\\n          telemetry.boostIntensity,\\n          state.clock.elapsedTime,\\n        );\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (phase === \'paused\') {\\n      // Freeze flight physics while keeping engine exhaust idling softly\\n      if (shipRootRef.current) {\\n        shipRootRef.current.position.copy(flight.position);\\n        shipRootRef.current.quaternion.copy(flight.quaternion);\\n      }\\n      shipHandle.updateVisuals(dt * 0.25, 0.2, 0, 0, 0, 0);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Menu, Hangar, or Loading showcase mode\\n    const t = state.clock.elapsedTime;\\n    const hoverY = _showcaseOrigin.y + Math.sin(t * 1.15) * 0.28;\\n\\n    if (shipRootRef.current) {\\n      shipRootRef.current.position.set(_showcaseOrigin.x, hoverY, _showcaseOrigin.z);\\n      shipRootRef.current.quaternion.setFromEuler(\\n        new THREE.Euler(Math.sin(t * 0.7) * 0.04, 0, Math.cos(t * 0.85) * 0.06),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    if (shipBankRef.current) {\\n      shipBankRef.current.rotation.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    }\\n\\n    shipHandle.updateVisuals(dt, 0.32, menuSection === \'hangar\' ? 0.18 : 0.12, 0, 0, 0);\\n\\n    if (camera instanceof THREE.PerspectiveCamera) {\\n      const mode = menuSection === \'hangar\' ? \'hangar\' : \'menu\';\\n      cameraController.updateShowcase(\\n        dt,\\n        _showcaseOrigin,\\n        camera,\\n        mode,\\n        mode === \'hangar\' ? hangarOrbitRef.current.yaw : 0,\\n        mode === \'hangar\' ? hangarOrbitRef.current.pitch : 0,\\n      );\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      <SpaceEnvironment graphics={graphics} />\\n\\n      <group ref={shipRootRef} position={[0, 12, 40]}>\\n        <group ref={shipBankRef}>\\n          <primitive object={shipHandle.group} />\\n        </group>\\n      </group>\\n\\n      <SpeedLinesVFX\\n        flight={flight}\\n        telemetryRef={telemetryRef}\\n        count={graphics.speedLineCount}\\n        active={phase === \'playing\'}\\n      />\\n    </>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement GameScene coordinating R3F useFrame loop, FlightController, CameraController, ShipModel, SpaceEnvironment, and SpeedLinesVFX\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scene/GameScene.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating GameScene component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/scene/GameScene.tsx\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4420484344710918831"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useCallback, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Canvas } from \'@react-three/fiber\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport type { GraphicsPreset } from \'../config/graphics\';\\nimport type { FlightController } from \'../engine/FlightController\';\\nimport type { InputManager } from \'../engine/InputManager\';\\nimport type {\\n  FlightTelemetry,\\n  GamePhase,\\n  GameSettings,\\n  MenuSection,\\n  ShipId,\\n} from \'../types/game\';\\nimport { GameScene } from \'./GameScene\';\\n\\ninterface FlightCanvasProps {\\n  phase: GamePhase;\\n  menuSection: MenuSection;\\n  activeShipId: ShipId;\\n  hangarShipId: ShipId;\\n  flight: FlightController;\\n  input: InputManager;\\n  settingsRef: React.MutableRefObject<GameSettings>;\\n  telemetryRef: React.MutableRefObject<FlightTelemetry>;\\n  graphics: GraphicsPreset;\\n  hangarOrbitRef: React.MutableRefObject<{ yaw: number; pitch: number }>;\\n  snapCameraSignal: number;\\n  onCanvasReady: (canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) => void;\\n  onCanvasClick: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function FlightCanvas({\\n  phase,\\n  menuSection,\\n  activeShipId,\\n  hangarShipId,\\n  flight,\\n  input,\\n  settingsRef,\\n  telemetryRef,\\n  graphics,\\n  hangarOrbitRef,\\n  snapCameraSignal,\\n  onCanvasReady,\\n  onCanvasClick,\\n}: FlightCanvasProps) {\\n  const [contextLost, setContextLost] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleCreated = useCallback(\\n    ({ gl }: { gl: THREE.WebGLRenderer }) => {\\n      const dom = gl.domElement;\\n      onCanvasReady(dom);\\n\\n      const onLost = (e: Event) => {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        setContextLost(true);\\n      };\\n      const onRestored = () => {\\n        setContextLost(false);\\n      };\\n\\n      dom.addEventListener(\'webglcontextlost\', onLost, false);\\n      dom.addEventListener(\'webglcontextrestored\', onRestored, false);\\n    },\\n    [onCanvasReady],\\n  );\\n\\n  if (contextLost) {\\n    return (\\n      <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#030712] text-slate-200\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-md border border-cyan-500/30 bg-[#071124] px-8 py-6 text-center\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-wider text-cyan-300\\\">\\n            Graphics Context Interrupted\\n          </h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400\\\">\\n            WebGL rendering was temporarily suspended by the browser. Reload the page to restore the 3D viewport.\\n          </p>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => window.location.reload()}\\n            className=\\\"mt-5 bg-cyan-500 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition-colors hover:bg-cyan-400\\\"\\n          >\\n            Reload Simulation\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 h-full w-full bg-[#030712]\\\"\\n      onMouseDown={() => {\\n        if (phase === \'playing\') {\\n          onCanvasClick();\\n        }\\n      }}\\n    >\\n      <Canvas\\n        shadows={graphics.shadows}\\n        dpr={[1, graphics.dprCap]}\\n        camera={{ fov: 62, near: 0.25, far: graphics.drawDistance, position: [0, 16, 52] }}\\n        gl={{\\n          antialias: graphics.antialias,\\n          powerPreference: \'high-performance\',\\n          toneMapping: THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping,\\n          toneMappingExposure: 1.12,\\n          outputColorSpace: THREE.SRGBColorSpace,\\n        }}\\n        onCreated={handleCreated}\\n      >\\n        <GameScene\\n          phase={phase}\\n          menuSection={menuSection}\\n          activeShipId={activeShipId}\\n          hangarShipId={hangarShipId}\\n          flight={flight}\\n          input={input}\\n          settingsRef={settingsRef}\\n          telemetryRef={telemetryRef}\\n          graphics={graphics}\\n          hangarOrbitRef={hangarOrbitRef}\\n          snapCameraSignal={snapCameraSignal}\\n        />\\n      </Canvas>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create isolated full-viewport FlightCanvas wrapper with ACES Filmic tone mapping, adaptive DPR, and WebGL context-loss recovery\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scene/FlightCanvas.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating FlightCanvas wrapper\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/scene/FlightCanvas.tsx\"}"
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
