    thinking: "**Executing Phase 3 Implementation**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation phase. I am currently focusing on Batch 2 which includes core types, the graphics configuration, ship default settings, and difficulty. I am aiming for clean, cohesive batches of parallel tool calls.\n\n\n**Refining Graphics Configuration**\n\nI\'m now refining the graphics configuration within `/src/types/game.ts`. I\'m integrating granular controls for resolution scaling, shadow and effect qualities, environment detail, and draw distance. Also, I\'ve added flight telemetry data for performance monitoring and updated `LoadingProgress` with optional mission details and error handling.\n\n\n**Adjusting Core Combat Logic**\n\nI\'m now integrating new combat-related types into `/src/types/combat.ts`. I\'m adding `difficultyLevel`, `isPriorityTarget`, and `coordinationTimer` to `EnemyEntity`, and `isPriorityTarget` to `ProjectedEnemyMarker`. Concurrently, I\'m cleaning up `game.ts` by removing a redundant `MissionDefinition` stub and/or re-exporting it from `./mission`.\n\n\n**Implementing Graphics Controls**\n\nI am now focusing on refining graphics controls in the game configuration, specifically `/src/config/ships.ts`. I am updating `DEFAULT_SETTINGS` with new graphics fields matching the \"high\" preset. Also, I\'m updating `loadSavedSettings()` to validate loaded values. In `/src/config/botPersonalities.ts`, I\'m updating `resolveBotDifficultyTuning()` to accept either a `DifficultyLevel` or a numeric scale, and I\'m updating `/src/engine/combat/EnemyAIController.ts` to use new tuning data.\n\n\n**Integrating Combat Updates**\n\nI\'m now integrating the combat logic updates. I\'ve scaled the burst active duration according to `tuning.burstPressureScale`, creating dynamic offensive pressure. I\'ve added a `missionMode` flag to `CombatManager` to control endless skirmishes and `beginMissionSession` and `spawnMissionWave` for specific mission waves, including parameters like `isPriorityTarget`. I\'m also exposing key methods to manage and track enemy and projectile counts, as well as priority targets. I\'ve integrated priority target projections. Finally, I\'ve updated the `onDestruction` payload.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "Xwz_asfIE_31qtsPkJHN0Q8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15604263696875504041"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import type * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport type { CombatStats, ProjectedEnemyMarker } from \'./combat\';\\n\\nexport type GamePhase = \'menu\' | \'loading\' | \'playing\' | \'paused\' | \'results\';\\n\\nexport type MenuSection = \'main\' | \'missions\' | \'hangar\' | \'settings\';\\n\\nexport type ShipId = \'interceptor\' | \'striker\' | \'destroyer\';\\n\\nexport type GraphicsQuality = \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\' | \'ultra\';\\n\\nexport type ShadowQuality = \'off\' | \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\';\\n\\nexport type EffectQuality = \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\';\\n\\nexport type FlightStatus =\\n  | \'STANDBY\'\\n  | \'CRUISING\'\\n  | \'ACCELERATING\'\\n  | \'BOOSTING\'\\n  | \'REVERSING\'\\n  | \'DRIFTING\'\\n  | \'BOOST DEPLETED\';\\n\\nexport interface ShipFlightProfile {\\n  /** Base forward max speed in m/s */\\n  maxSpeed: number;\\n  /** Reverse max speed in m/s */\\n  maxReverseSpeed: number;\\n  /** Forward thrust acceleration in m/s^2 */\\n  acceleration: number;\\n  /** Braking / reverse thrust acceleration in m/s^2 */\\n  deceleration: number;\\n  /** Passive velocity drag when no thrust key is pressed */\\n  passiveDrag: number;\\n  /** How quickly the velocity vector aligns with ship nose (arcade lateral grip) */\\n  lateralGrip: number;\\n  /** Boost speed multiplier applied to maxSpeed */\\n  boostMultiplier: number;\\n  /** Boost acceleration multiplier */\\n  boostAccelMultiplier: number;\\n  /** Boost energy pool (0-100) */\\n  maxBoostEnergy: number;\\n  /** Energy consumed per second while boosting */\\n  boostDrainRate: number;\\n  /** Energy regenerated per second when not boosting */\\n  boostRegenRate: number;\\n  /** Delay in seconds after stopping boost before regen begins */\\n  boostRegenDelay: number;\\n  /** Max yaw angular speed in rad/s */\\n  yawSpeed: number;\\n  /** Max pitch angular speed in rad/s */\\n  pitchSpeed: number;\\n  /** Max roll angular speed in rad/s */\\n  rollSpeed: number;\\n  /** Angular response damping (higher = snappier stop) */\\n  angularDamping: number;\\n  /** Subtle automatic visual banking induced by yaw */\\n  visualBankStrength: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ShipWeaponSpec {\\n  primaryName: string;\\n  damageRating: number; // 0-100 normalized for UI comparison\\n  fireRateRating: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ShipConfig {\\n  id: ShipId;\\n  callsign: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  role: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  /** Whether playable in single-player campaign */\\n  playableInPhase1: boolean;\\n  unlockNote: string;\\n  maxHull: number;\\n  /** Normalized 0-100 ratings for hangar specification bars */\\n  ratings: {\\n    speed: number;\\n    maneuverability: number;\\n    hull: number;\\n    firepower: number;\\n  };\\n  colors: {\\n    hullPrimary: string;\\n    hullSecondary: string;\\n    hullTrim: string;\\n    canopy: string;\\n    engineCore: string;\\n    engineGlow: string;\\n  };\\n  flight: ShipFlightProfile;\\n  weapons: ShipWeaponSpec;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GameSettings {\\n  mouseSensitivity: number; // 0.3 to 2.4\\n  invertY: boolean;\\n  cameraDistance: number; // 7.2 to 13.5\\n  cameraSensitivity: number; // 0.6 to 1.6\\n  masterVolume: number; // 0 to 1\\n  graphicsQuality: GraphicsQuality;\\n  resolutionScale: number; // 0.65 to 1.0\\n  shadowQuality: ShadowQuality;\\n  particleQuality: EffectQuality;\\n  environmentDetail: EffectQuality;\\n  drawDistance: number; // 2000 to 5200\\n  antialias: boolean;\\n  postGlowEnabled: boolean;\\n  /** Development-only performance monitor toggle (hidden in production builds) */\\n  showPerfOverlay: boolean;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * High-frequency mutable telemetry updated every simulation frame.\\n * Read directly via refs inside HUD animation loops to guarantee zero React re-renders per frame.\\n */\\nexport interface FlightTelemetry {\\n  speed: number;\\n  signedSpeed: number;\\n  maxSpeed: number;\\n  effectiveMaxSpeed: number;\\n  throttle: number; // -1 to 1\\n  boostEnergy: number; // 0 to 100\\n  maxBoostEnergy: number;\\n  isBoosting: boolean;\\n  boostDepleted: boolean;\\n  boostIntensity: number; // 0 to 1 smoothly damped\\n  hull: number;\\n  maxHull: number;\\n  yawRate: number; // normalized -1..1\\n  pitchRate: number; // normalized -1..1\\n  rollRate: number; // normalized -1..1\\n  /** Normalized instantaneous turn input feedback (-1..1) */\\n  aimNormalizedX: number;\\n  aimNormalizedY: number;\\n  /** Screen-space [0..1] position of true 3D weapon aiming reticle */\\n  aimScreenX: number;\\n  aimScreenY: number;\\n  /** Screen-space [0..1] position of ship boresight */\\n  boresightScreenX: number;\\n  boresightScreenY: number;\\n  headingDeg: number; // 0..359\\n  pitchDeg: number; // -90..90\\n  rollDeg: number; // -180..180\\n  altitude: number;\\n  status: FlightStatus;\\n  pointerLocked: boolean;\\n  // Combat telemetry\\n  isFiring: boolean;\\n  weaponName: string;\\n  weaponCooldownRatio: number;\\n  hitMarkerTimer: number;\\n  killMarkerTimer: number;\\n  damageFlashTimer: number;\\n  muzzleFlashLeft: number;\\n  muzzleFlashRight: number;\\n  playerDestroyed: boolean;\\n  combatStats: CombatStats;\\n  enemyMarkers: ProjectedEnemyMarker[];\\n  // Performance metrics (read by dev-only performance monitor)\\n  fps: number;\\n  frameTimeMs: number;\\n  drawCalls: number;\\n  triangles: number;\\n  activeProjectiles: number;\\n  activeParticles: number;\\n  activeEnemies: number;\\n  lastAssetLoadMs: number;\\n  cachedAssetCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LoadingProgress {\\n  stage: string;\\n  percent: number;\\n  shipId: ShipId;\\n  missionCode?: string;\\n  missionName?: string;\\n  sectorName?: string;\\n  error?: string | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport type BotPersonality = \'aggressor\' | \'flanker\' | \'defender\' | \'ace\';\\n\\nexport type MissionRank = \'S\' | \'A\' | \'B\' | \'C\';\\n\\nexport interface ShipVisualHandle {\\n  group: THREE.Group;\\n  updateVisuals: (\\n    dt: number,\\n    speedRatio: number,\\n    boostIntensity: number,\\n    yawInput: number,\\n    pitchInput: number,\\n    rollInput: number,\\n  ) => void;\\n  setDetailLevel?: (highDetail: boolean) => void;\\n  dispose: () => void;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update game types for Phase 3 campaign missions, adaptive graphics presets, granular quality settings, and dev performance telemetry\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/game.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating game types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update game types\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\3131\n\3101\001i\024}\023\346\373\251\272+\004+\224\253\363\022\363\366\253\312\314T&\216\t\326A4F\334\221\r\362\212\236\231\017\247\264G\216\020\225~\241a\256\024\207K/r<f\340\301\306\311\313\223Y\222\244\313\370\003\275\337\364e\262\2539e\323\f\335\'KG \231\235\3677\003Q\016=\375\267\255\243o\213\357t\240\230\310p\373\304\377\024N\277\034\366\321,\201eo\274\002T\343i\317\002X\375u\260^l&2\003\246\322\3745\320\267\032\220\241\201\351~\261\333\210Ux\202=\235\257\v\242s\025\315\374\017\003\354\027\204J/L\035\276_\376\360F\312\021\266H\270\\\311\006\334\2734_\017\235\267\353\305\205\v\265\373\300A`\236\001\245\256G\277l\364\227\301\376/\271\244\341\234\236q\004\324:a\266\241\353\342\345Bn\353w\227\035\3345H\300\324t\317}\252&\270\362Wi\220\377\327u\255N^Af\263\022\024cW\346\260\375\277-\220\201\352\356\335\220\355\214\374\243\330\204Wt\275\006\006\276\r\314\302B\2761\240r\314\224^_]{\266\232l\336\fr3\210%2}b\322\300\303\241C\244\363\b{\261\303\265\261\371\2027\026S+o\316\311\261\004\227\023%,\227\034\372\254\365l\253o\032Dr\"\006\026i\376\t\236w\231\257bLP\226\364\201\214\372h\205\212\r\001U\020\220\331\276#`\265\344\366z\363\035y\204S\230\360\240n1\'#n\207\224\316C\024\342\035\304\367\364\263\r\352\034T\235\276L\b\335F\021\034M&\222\003[\356\n\264\251\244h\276/\345f\001I\377\201t\027\325gb\235\354\264\354\226\334c\311\306K01\241\016\317\252=\267\277\211\206\026\326\257\262\333A\352\253}{k\036\362T\2525\365\305\016E.\342\032\002<<tiS\201\aeh\341\a\023Mu\n\243~\240\323\026d\373M\351\344\234a\231\020\256\n\037\204R\374\205iK}\242\370\360\374$\322M\254\206C]y:\326\245\224\334\353\366` \333V\345\235 1\257\335\254\243\351\356\005[B\026\323A\3402ZM\343%p\327\240V\254\006V\322@\307\360\314\274\030cV\0170\352v\364\372\333\224i\377\345!3\222m\004R\316H\202\203\231\234\326\3532\331\3673-a\361~\273:\025v\202\375l\211\202\001\3366\321\b\307A\207\274ri.\226\bA5_&\3213\326{P\303)G\242\021F\3577^d\017\334\266N\245lb\256\370b\031\327WmD\0028\3153\353\3