  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Batch 5**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in constructing Batch 5. The focus is on the Campaign UI, Mission Results, and refining the user experience with progressive loading, error handling, and an improved HUD. The enhanced HUD will feature an objectives panel and tactical announcements. I\'m also working on adaptive graphics, and key UI components such as the Main Menu and Pause Overlay, and the important App.tsx file.\n\n\n**Refining UI Design**\n\nI\'m now deep in refining the UI design, focusing specifically on `/src/components/MissionSelectView.tsx` and `/src/components/MissionResultsOverlay.tsx`. My goal is to ensure each UI piece aligns with STARFALL\'s visual identity: deep navy, electric cyan, dark metallic, keeping a high typographic contrast, no WebGL `backdrop-blur` or unnecessary clutter. I\'m carefully constructing the MissionSelectView to clearly display campaign missions, the tactical briefing, the `Launch Mission` button and the top bar elements. I\'m also starting work on the post-mission debrief screens.\n\n\n**Designing Mission Results**\n\nI\'m now designing the mission results overlay. I\'m focusing on a prominent rank emblem and a deterministic score breakdown, using bars for visual clarity. I\'m also implementing a metrics grid displaying key stats like enemies defeated and accuracy. I\'ve included an unlock notification banner and functional buttons to navigate the user to their next step.\n\nI\'m also working on the LoadingScreen.tsx, which will feature a mission code, sector name, selected craft, and a loading bar. It has a cancel button for aborting and a structured error recovery UI for failed asset loads. Finally, I\'ve started on FlightHUD.tsx and adding a mission objectives panel.\n\n\n**Optimizing HUD Layout**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the Mission Objectives Panel and Tactical Announcement Banner. Positioning the objectives panel on the top-right below the pause button keeps the central viewport clear. I\'m incorporating live status icons and counters for each objective, and the announcement banner will be above the target card. I\'ve removed the aiming reticle\'s rubber-band tether and refined the priority target highlight. Also, I\'m working on the development-only performance monitor.\n\n\n**Implementing Graphics Controls**\n\nI\'ve completed integrating the granular graphics controls in SettingsPanel. I\'ve included four presets and sliders and selectors for all settings. There\'s a development-only performance monitor, and I\'m ready to move onto the MainMenu and PauseOverlay. The MainMenu has a \"Play Campaign\" button, which opens Mission Select, as well as a \"Quick Launch\" button, which directs to the latest unlocked mission.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "1w3_atDyFMPoz7IPxNeM4QU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15786545757922108103"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { ArrowLeft, CheckCircle2, Crosshair, Lock, Play, ShieldAlert, Trophy } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { AudioManager } from \'../audio/AudioManager\';\\nimport { DIFFICULTY_PROFILES } from \'../config/difficulty\';\\nimport { CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS } from \'../config/missions\';\\nimport { isMissionUnlocked } from \'../engine/mission/CampaignProgressStore\';\\nimport type { MissionRank } from \'../types/game\';\\nimport type { CampaignSaveData, MissionDefinition } from \'../types/mission\';\\n\\ninterface MissionSelectViewProps {\\n  campaignSave: CampaignSaveData;\\n  selectedMissionId: string;\\n  onSelectMission: (missionId: string) => void;\\n  onLaunchMission: (mission: MissionDefinition) => void;\\n  onBack: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nconst RANK_STYLE: Record<MissionRank, string> = {\\n  S: \'border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-200\',\\n  A: \'border-sky-400/60 bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-200\',\\n  B: \'border-slate-500/70 bg-slate-700/35 text-slate-200\',\\n  C: \'border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-200\',\\n};\\n\\nfunction formatTime(sec: number | null): string {\\n  if (sec === null || !Number.isFinite(sec)) return \'--:--\';\\n  const m = Math.floor(sec / 60);\\n  const s = Math.floor(sec % 60);\\n  return `${String(m).padStart(2, \'0\')}:${String(s).padStart(2, \'0\')}`;\\n}\\n\\nexport function MissionSelectView({\\n  campaignSave,\\n  selectedMissionId,\\n  onSelectMission,\\n  onLaunchMission,\\n  onBack,\\n}: MissionSelectViewProps) {\\n  const selected =\\n    CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS.find((m) => m.id === selectedMissionId) ?? CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS[0];\\n  const selectedRecord = campaignSave.missions[selected.id];\\n  const selectedUnlocked = isMissionUnlocked(selected, campaignSave);\\n  const completedCount = CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS.filter((m) => campaignSave.missions[m.id]?.completed).length;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-20 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#030712]/76 p-5 sm:p-8 lg:p-10\\\">\\n      {/* Top Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-800/90 pb-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onMouseEnter={() => AudioManager.playUiHover()}\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              AudioManager.playUiClick(\'secondary\');\\n              onBack();\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-700/80 bg-[#050c1d]/90 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-cyan-400/60 hover:text-cyan-200 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            <ArrowLeft className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>Main Menu</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <div>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-50\\\">\\n              Campaign Operations\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              Select a combat deployment. Complete missions to unlock higher-threat sectors.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden items-center gap-3 border border-slate-800 bg-[#050c1d]/90 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs sm:flex\\\">\\n          <Trophy className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Progress</span>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n            {completedCount} / {CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS.length}\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Split Layout: Mission List + Tactical Briefing */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto my-5 grid w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 grid-cols-1 gap-5 overflow-y-auto lg:grid-cols-12\\\">\\n        {/* Left: 5 Mission Cards */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 lg:col-span-5\\\">\\n          {CAMPAIGN_MISSIONS.map((mission) => {\\n            const unlocked = isMissionUnlocked(mission, campaignSave);\\n            const record = campaignSave.missions[mission.id];\\n            const isSelected = mission.id === selected.id;\\n            const diffLabel = DIFFICULTY_PROFILES[mission.difficulty].label;\\n\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={mission.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onMouseEnter={() => AudioManager.playUiHover()}\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  AudioManager.playUiClick(\'secondary\');\\n                  onSelectMission(mission.id);\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border px-4 py-3.5 text-left transition-colors ${\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? \'border-cyan-400 bg-[#081631]/95 text-slate-50\'\\n                    : unlocked\\n                      ? \'border-slate-800 bg-[#050c1d]/90 text-slate-200 hover:border-slate-600\'\\n                      : \'border-slate-800/70 bg-[#040915]/85 text-slate-500 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400\\\">\\n                      {mission.code}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-display text-base font-semibold tracking-wide truncate\\\">\\n                      {mission.name}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    <span>{diffLabel}</span>\\n                    <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                    <span>{mission.environment.sectorName}</span>\\n                    <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                    <span>{mission.totalEnemyCount} Hostiles</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n                  {record?.bestRank && (\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center border font-display text-sm font-bold ${RANK_STYLE[record.bestRank]}`}\\n                    >\\n                      {record.bestRank}\\n                    </span>\\n                  )}\\n                  {record?.completed ? (\\n                    <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400\\\" aria-label=\\\"Completed\\\" />\\n                  ) : !unlocked ? (\\n                    <Lock className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-slate-500\\\" aria-label=\\\"Locked\\\" />\\n                  ) : null}\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right: Detailed Tactical Briefing */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col justify-between border border-slate-700/80 bg-[#050c1d]/94 p-6 lg:col-span-7\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                  <span>MISSION {String(selected.number).padStart(2, \'0\')}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                  <span>{selected.environment.sectorName.toUpperCase()}</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <h2 className=\\\"mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-50\\\">\\n                  {selected.name}\\n                </h2>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"text-right font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Threat Level</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-orange-300\\\">\\n                  {DIFFICULTY_PROFILES[selected.difficulty].label.toUpperCase()}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300\\\">\\n              {selected.description}\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* Mission Parameters */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"border border-slate-800 bg-[#081226] px-3 py-2.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">Hostiles</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100\\\">\\n                  {selected.totalEnemyCount}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"border border-slate-800 bg-[#081226] px-3 py-2.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">Waves</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100\\\">\\n                  {selected.waves.length}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"border border-slate-800 bg-[#081226] px-3 py-2.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">Par Time</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100\\\">\\n                  {formatTime(selected.parTimeSec)}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"border border-slate-800 bg-[#081226] px-3 py-2.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">Best Record</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                  {selectedRecord?.bestRank\\n                    ? `${selectedRecord.bestRank} \302\267 ${selectedRecord.bestScore}`\\n                    : \'Unranked\'}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Objectives List */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-5\\\">\\n              <h3 className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-slate-400\\\">\\n                <Crosshair className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n                <span>MISSION OBJECTIVES</span>\\n              </h3>\\n              <ul className=\\\"mt-2 space-y-2\\\">\\n                {selected.objectives.map((obj) => (\\n                  <li\\n                    key={obj.id}\\n                    className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border border-slate-800/90 bg-[#081226]/70 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>{obj.label}</span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                      {obj.type === \'survive_duration\'\\n                        ? `${obj.targetDurationSec}s`\\n                        : obj.type === \'defeat_target\'\\n                          ? obj.targetCallsign\\n                          : `${obj.targetCount}`}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </li>\\n                ))}\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Reward & Best Time Info */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/90 pt-3 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <span>{selected.rewardLabel}</span>\\n              {selectedRecord?.bestTimeSec && (\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-300\\\">\\n                  Best Time: {formatTime(selectedRecord.bestTimeSec)}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Launch Action */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-6 border-t border-slate-800 pt-4\\\">\\n            {selectedUnlocked ? (\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onMouseEnter={() => AudioManager.playUiHover()}\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  AudioManager.unlock();\\n                  AudioManager.playUiClick(\'primary\');\\n                  onLaunchMission(selected);\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-cyan-500 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-950 transition-colors hover:bg-cyan-400 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-cyan-300\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Play className=\\\"h-4 w-4 fill-current\\\" />\\n                <span>Launch {selected.code} \342\200\224 {selected.name}</span>\\n              </button>\\n            ) : (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 border border-slate-700 bg-[#081226] px-5 py-3.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                <ShieldAlert className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-amber-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>\\n                  Complete Mission {String(selected.number - 1).padStart(2, \'0\')} to unlock this deployment.\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Quiet Footer */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n        <span>Active Craft: VX-9 Vanguard Interceptor</span>\\n        <span>Ranks: S (820+) \302\267 A (660+) \302\267 B (480+) \302\267 C</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create MissionSelectView displaying all 5 campaign missions, difficulty, lock/completion status, best ranks, objectives, and launch action\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/MissionSelectView.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating MissionSelectView component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create MissionSelectView component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\3620\n\3570\001i\024}\023\255\255s\217\201/\245d\005#\\%$,\207\225\203\021\216\300j\030\250\271Aqh\376e\320\215\032\230\214*E\253*\220\341<\275\031\277L\241(\023\212\373w\207W\271\306\227\326\365\000/\261\216qSa6\001\222o\263+\265i#!\333QB|\300\216%\000+/0\033\317/\303n\206\256x\037wY\fn\022\024\237\320Tr>\017\360\2778;Z\33345\021\340\2068qI\314#A\006\003\352A\270N\243R&\367?\345\377\vk\003\365\202\214\256\2443\307\252>\376_\361\306\020\rg\222\344Y\330\006\255\262@*A/\225\r\2310-\000z\0227\257\342\244l9\316|\'%_>\216\016\n\005\026\v\207K\\HH\bC\217\343<[\212\366\277]i\375\n\362\355NW$\236\367:\021\351,\237U:\332U\202GP\331\230\321\345\033[\026\215\371\362\372\321|\024\261(\351\270]9\366\nF\355^s\324\024\341!\203\321\347\261\374Keu\265p\234&\235$\004\354\275\273\367\271\312\037\262\017\324\275\372Ki.g(\342\310\247\223-\026\023\033\251e\310\273\200r2\304\364]\310z\331\206vd\035\355\344\n\026}\261hj\211hw\2220\202\251%\271h)\337f\244\271g\003\346\\\345m0\372~\270\247\237\327\241\320Sd\246)\232\251 \263$gP\254\022e\331FsO\340\316s\223\277\330Y\276\234\325\254*P\3319\000/\fLU\330.doY\347N\21317\016K\242\302C\2476\354\035,\266\023L\022\246a*\251\323@ \2431\357b\245\233G\320\026\035\n7\020K\377\352F\2451H\213\304\272\274Ho6\352\035tJ>~N\r\366\a\t\225\320\\\354\t;\277\036\246\f%\353\021\376\347\035\302\212\255\177\343A\004\330\304N1\373X9\266F\004bD=\350\264[\371\352\2607\212\255\301\357LA\0266\320g\367\352\241Rr_\272}\265U\236Q\236\247\375\270\254\352\232Em-i\365>Uc\2355[\036x<;NE[\a\316;\326i\377\354\254\372o\323\343\321\373\326N=%\241\025\213\353c\365\302r\323\356v\026Y\026\260\206y\rq\031\2501\275\276\"\022\207\\\fW\214\r\3741\"\226\232\223F%\351\230\262\vA\247\352\261\305\214\276[D\213\330(\3619b\260\345\b\006\304\374$\344\227\'\376X\022!\261N\274\177(\303\320\206\274\332:#\232o\232\231\271:FW\177\305\275\227}\337\331G]\307\325Y\233\203\177|\375\333X\375\202z\270\213\2331\'\236\024\334\213\277\272\375\223\033k\310:\321W\b\355@j\376\240_D