        instruction: "Update InputManager.ts to use synchronous standard requestPointerLock, verify canvas ownership via document.pointerLockElement === this.lockTarget, guard against duplicate listener attachment, and filter OS/browser boundary cursor-warp rollback spikes without restricting legitimate mouse turning."
