  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining HUD Display**\n\nI\'m currently focused on precisely rendering the virtual mouse steering cursor within `/src/components/FlightHUD.tsx`. The goal is for the `aimReticleRef` to consistently display at calculated screen coordinates (`t.aimScreenX * vw, t.aimScreenY * vh`). The key is ensuring this cursor remains at screen edges without snapping or rolling back to the center of the display.\n\n\n**Adding Steering Vector**\n\nI\'ve added a steering vector line from screen center to the persistent cursor for clearer spatial understanding during edge turns. Also, I\'m integrating the ship\'s 3D cannon boresight reticle for accurate hit confirmation. I\'m prioritizing accuracy, and I\'m updating `CombatManager.ts` to rank targets based on the boresight reticle coordinates for dead-on weapon convergence. I\'m removing an unused variable in the same section too.\n\n\n"
