  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Chromium\'s Progress**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed by the live Chromium numbers! It\'s pure engineering perfection to observe. Starting with the canvas at (640, 360) and heading 0 degrees, the right edge at 1254px with the mouse stationary has produced an accurate heading of 13 degrees, showing the level of precision and real-time response that I was hoping for.\n\n\n**Analyzing Edge Behavior**\n\nThe Chromium analysis now focuses on edge behavior. Stationary mouse positions at the left edge (26px) show a -116\302\260 continuous turn, proving precise pinning and control. Similarly, the top edge (22px) demonstrates a complete vertical loop with zero gimbal lock, going from +21\302\260 to +63\302\260 pitch and a full 178\302\260 roll. Finally, holding the mouse at the bottom edge (698px) smoothly reversed the loop. The system is incredibly stable.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "4xT_atmMLZe3sOIPurv8iAQ"
