  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Bug\'s Source**\n\nI\'ve homed in on the initial positioning bug in `FlightHUD.tsx`. Specifically, lines 464 and 514 are where the refs `boresightRef` and `aimReticleRef` were lacking the necessary `transform: translate3d(50vw, 50vh, 0) translate(-50%, -50%)` applied immediately. This caused them to briefly flash at the top-left corner before the RAF corrected them.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "yxr_aqXfF7ehkdUPgIj2qAE"
    tool_calls {
