    model_api_content_id: "gx__avPnO-3K_PUPrsX80AU"
  }
  planner_response {
    response: "### 1. Implemented Mathematical Response Curve & Architecture\n\nThe progressive three-zone steering model runs independently on horizontal (yaw) and vertical (pitch) axes inside `FlightController`, driven exclusively by relative Pointer Lock `movementX` / `movementY` deltas from `InputManager` (no absolute screen coordinates, no cursor recentering, no double-processed input, and decoupled from `CameraController`).\n\n#### Independent Per-Axis Displacement\nFor each axis ($x$ = accumulated virtual aim displacement in virtual pixels, scaled by **Base Sensitivity**):\n\n- Horizontal aiming boundary: $B_x = 800 \\cdot \\text{aimBoundarySize}$\n- Vertical aiming boundary: $B_y = 0.92 \\cdot B_x$\n- Acceleration distance scale: $S = \\text{accelerationDistance}$\n- Soft displacement upper buffer: $|x|_{\\max} = B + 4.0\\,S$ (where $f(4.0) = 0.941$ at $p = 2.0$, providing near-asymptotic acceleration without unbounded dead-travel when reversing).\n\n#### Three-Zone $C^1$-Continuous Sensitivity Curve (`evaluateProgressiveAxisSensitivity`)\n1. **Precision Zone ($|x| \\le B$)**:\n   - Core inner region ($|x| \\le 0.80\\,B$): preserves exact normal sensitivity $\\text{targetSens} = 1.0$.\n   - Boundary approach ($0.80\\,B < |x| \\le B$): Hermite smoothstep blend $s(t) = t^2(3 - 2t)$ smoothly eases sensitivity from $1.0$ down to `boundarySensitivity` with zero derivative at $|x| = B$, eliminating any step cliff on crossing.\n2. **Transition Zone ($|x| > B$ while $\\text{sensitivity}(e) < 1.0$)**:\n   - Excess normalized distance:\n     $$e = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\frac{|x| - B}{S}\\right)$$\n   - Nonlinear response curve:\n     $$f(e) = \\frac{e^p}{1 + e^p}$$\n   - Effective target sensitivity:\n     $$\\text{sensitivity}(e) = \\text{boundarySensitivity} + (\\text{maxSensitivity} - \\text{boundarySensitivity}) \\cdot f(e)$$\n   - Immediately past the boundary ($e \\approx 0^+$), steering slows smoothly toward `boundarySensitivity` (`0.35x`), then progressively climbs as the player continues pushing outward.\n3. **Acceleration Zone ($|x| > B$ while $\\text{sensitivity}(e) \\ge 1.0$)**:\n   - Continued outward displacement smoothly accelerates rotation past `1.0x` toward the asymptotic `maxSensitivity` ceiling (`2.5x`), capped against controllable angular safety limits (`3.2x` yaw / `3.0x` pitch base ship speed).\n\n#### Delta-Time Recovery Smoothing & Angular Integration\n- Each axis smoothly tracks its target sensitivity with a frame-rate-independent exponential filter ($\\tau = 0.12\\text{ s}$):\n  $$\\alpha_{\\text{rec}} = 1 - e^{-\\Delta t / 0.12}$$\n- Per-axis steering combines normalized deflection inside $B$ (with `3%` center deadzone and `1.15` precision shaping) multiplied by `smoothedSensX` / `smoothedSensY`, feeding into the restored Phase 1/2 arcade angular response (`angularDamping * 2.1` steering / `1.8` leveling) and quaternion local-space rotation.\n- On the HUD, the virtual reticle remains inside the configurable aiming boundary frame (plus a subtle `0\342\200\2232.8%` elastic tension offset in acceleration) with subtle zone tinting (cyan in Precision, amber-cyan in Transition, bright cyan-white in Acceleration).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Final Tuning Values & Player Settings\n\nAll six parameters are exposed in **Settings** (accessible from both the Main Menu and the in-flight Pause Menu, with a live `f(e)` curve preview SVG and `localStorage` persistence):\n\n| Setting | Default Value | Configurable Range | Role |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Base Sensitivity** | `1.00x` | `0.30x \342\200\223 2.50x` | Scales relative `movementX`/`movementY` accumulation |\n| **Boundary Sensitivity** | `0.35x` | `0.15x \342\200\223 1.00x` | Initial slowed sensitivity upon crossing boundary ($e = 0$) |\n| **Maximum Sensitivity** | `2.50x` | `1.20x \342\200\223 3.50x` | Asymptotic top multiplier in the Acceleration Zone |\n| **Acceleration Distance** | `240 px` | `80 \342\200\223 500 px` | Scale $S$ where $f(1.0) = 0.50$ halfway to max sensitivity |\n| **Response Curve** | `p = 2.0` | `1.0 \342\200\223 3.5` | Nonlinearity exponent $p$ in $f(e) = e^p / (1 + e^p)$ |\n| **Aim Boundary Size** | `25%` (`B = 200 px`) | `15% \342\200\223 38%` | Precision boundary width on screen & virtual displacement $B$ |\n| **Recovery Smoothing** (fixed internal) | `0.12 s` | \342\200\224 | Delta-time exponential transition & precision recovery constant |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification Results\n\n#### Build & Type Check\n- `compile_applet`: Passed.\n- `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`): Passed with `0` errors.\n\n#### Simulation Physics & Frame-Rate Verification (`tsx`)\n- **Curve checkpoints (`B = 200 px`, `S = 240 px`, `p = 2.0`)**:\n  - `x = 0..160 px` (`precision`): `1.000x`\n  - `x = 180 px` (boundary smoothstep): `0.675x`\n  - `x = 200 px` ($e = 0$): `0.350x`\n  - `x = 220 px` ($e = 0.08$, `transition`): `0.365x`\n  - `x = 320 px` ($e = 0.50$, `transition`): `0.780x`\n  - `x = 440 px` ($e = 1.00$, `acceleration`): `1.425x`\n  - `x = 680 px` ($e = 2.00$, `acceleration`): `2.070x`\n- **Settled yaw turn speed (Interceptor)**:\n  - Precision (`140 px`): `1.372 rad/s`\n  - Transition (`215 px`): `0.757 rad/s` (slower immediately past boundary)\n  - Acceleration (`440 px`): `2.990 rad/s`\n  - Deep Acceleration (`680 px`): `4.340 rad/s`\n  - Max single-frame `\316\224yawVelocity` across a continuous `0 \342\206\222 750 px` sweep: `0.158 rad/s` (zero spikes).\n- **Frame-rate stability (`1.0 s` turn across `30 / 60 / 120 / 240 Hz`)**:\n  - Precision (`120 px`): `-62.13\302\260 / -61.66\302\260 / -61.41\302\260 / -61.27\302\260` (`< 0.9\302\260` spread)\n  - Transition (`220 px`): `-49.73\302\260 / -50.00\302\260 / -50.14\302\260 / -50.21\302\260` (`< 0.5\302\260` spread)\n  - Acceleration (`440 px`): `-157.86\302\260 / -156.22\302\260 / -155.35\302\260 / -154.90\302\260` (identical settled `sensX = 1.425x`).\n\n#### Live Headless Chromium Browser Verification (`1280\303\227720`, Mission M-01)\n- **Settings UI**: All 6 progressive steering sliders and the live response curve SVG verified present. Adjusting **Aim Boundary Size** from `0.25 \342\206\222 0.32` in Pause Settings persisted `0.32` in `localStorage` and resized the live HUD boundary frame from `640 px \342\206\222 819 px` (`0.32 \303\227 2 \303\227 1280`).\n- **Pointer Lock & Errors**: `document.pointerLockElement === CANVAS`, `0` `pointerlockerror` events, `0` page errors, `0` console errors.\n- **Zone 1 \342\200\224 Precision (`+140 px`)**: `zone: \"precision\"`, `sensX: 1.000`, `cursorX: 864.0`, `0.0 px` rollback, 4-frame heading turn `+22\302\260`.\n- **Zone 2 \342\200\224 Transition (`+220 px`)**: `zone: \"transition\"`, `sensX: 0.375`, `cursorX: 960.2`, `0.0 px` rollback, 4-frame heading turn `+10\302\260` (slower than Precision).\n- **Zone 3 \342\200\224 Acceleration (`+440 px` \342\206\222 `+680 px`)**:\n  - At `+440 px` ($e = 1.0$): `zone: \"acceleration\"`, `sensX: 1.400`, `cursorX: 977.9`, 4-frame heading turn `+32\302\260`.\n  - At `+680 px` X + `+80 px` Y: `zone: \"acceleration\"`, `sensX: 2.054`, **`sensY: 1.000`** (independent vertical precision confirmed), `cursorX: 988.7`, 4-frame heading turn `+49\302\260`.\n- **Smooth Return to Precision (`+680 px \342\206\222 +120 px` via 8 realistic `-70 px` events)**:\n  - `cursorX` returned to `832.0` (`zone: \"precision\"`); `sensX` recovered smoothly over frames (`2.061 \342\206\222 1.700 \342\206\222 1.200 \342\206\222 1.025 \342\206\222 1.000`) with zero rotation spikes.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Remaining Issues\n\n- None identified in build, simulation, or headless Chromium tests. If a player has an unusually high mouse DPI (`> 3200 DPI`), they may want to lower **Base Sensitivity** (`0.5x\342\200\2230.7x`) or widen **Acceleration Distance** (`300\342\200\223400 px`) in Settings to match their physical mousepad throw."
